WEBVTT


00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:06.100
Downloaded @ subs4free.club


00:01:05.219 --> 00:01:07.555
- Something wrong
superintendent?


00:01:07.588 --> 00:01:09.991
- Absolutely not Robert.


00:01:11.124 --> 00:01:17.730
Please proceed.


00:01:21.867 --> 00:01:25.003
- There's nothing wrong with me.


00:01:25.036 --> 00:01:26.905
- Shh.


00:01:26.938 --> 00:01:29.840
Miss Puge we're
here to help you.


00:01:29.873 --> 00:01:31.675
No need to be afraid.


00:01:31.708 --> 00:01:33.544
The librium of the
scrotum as diagnosed...


00:01:33.576 --> 00:01:34.611
- Get on with it.


00:01:34.644 --> 00:01:35.245
- Miss Puge.


00:01:35.278 --> 00:01:36.179
- No.


00:01:36.212 --> 00:01:39.048
- No one is out to get you.


00:01:39.081 --> 00:01:42.684
You're safe, this is part
of your treatment here


00:01:42.717 --> 00:01:44.987
at Blackwell's Island.


00:01:45.020 --> 00:01:48.189
You do want to get
well, don't you?


00:01:50.724 --> 00:01:54.127
- No, no, no.


00:01:54.160 --> 00:01:55.295
No.


00:02:00.032 --> 00:02:02.001
- Feel better now don't you?


00:02:04.936 --> 00:02:07.539
- Mama.


00:02:13.710 --> 00:02:14.644
- Doctor Kinier.


00:02:14.677 --> 00:02:17.880
What's happening?


00:02:17.913 --> 00:02:20.181
- I don't know if I have enough.


00:02:37.729 --> 00:02:39.264
- Can you hear me?


00:02:39.297 --> 00:02:40.732
Talk to me.


00:02:40.765 --> 00:02:42.101
- Enough!


00:02:45.703 --> 00:02:49.639
Send her to the crematorium.


00:02:49.672 --> 00:02:51.775
I will make out the papers.


00:04:35.760 --> 00:04:38.663
- I wasn't
always known as Nellie Bly.


00:04:38.696 --> 00:04:41.265
I was born Elizabeth Cockringe
during the Civil War,


00:04:41.298 --> 00:04:43.200
outside of Pittsburgh,
Pennsylvania.


00:04:43.233 --> 00:04:46.302
Since I was a child, I
wanted to be a reporter.


00:04:46.335 --> 00:04:49.105
It'd been two years since I
wrote the Pittsburgh Dispatch,


00:04:49.138 --> 00:04:52.174
to criticize an article that
mocked women looking for work.


00:04:52.207 --> 00:04:55.077
The managing editor was so
impressed with my response,


00:04:55.110 --> 00:04:57.145
that he made the rare
choice of hiring me,


00:04:57.178 --> 00:05:00.081
a female to work as a reporter.


00:05:00.114 --> 00:05:03.350
You see in 1887, journalism
was a man's world,


00:05:03.383 --> 00:05:06.687
an exclusive,
albeit, crusty cigar,


00:05:06.720 --> 00:05:08.754
and spittoon filled club.


00:05:08.787 --> 00:05:10.189
The women were not welcomed.


00:05:10.222 --> 00:05:11.424
- Nellie Bly.


00:05:11.457 --> 00:05:12.757
We were
considered too dainty


00:05:12.790 --> 00:05:14.859
and fragile for such work.


00:05:14.892 --> 00:05:17.395
So how did I, the
fabled mere woman,


00:05:17.428 --> 00:05:19.763
fair sex, a faint heart,


00:05:19.796 --> 00:05:23.233
become the most known investigative reporter in the world.


00:05:23.266 --> 00:05:25.702
Well, I have always believed


00:05:25.735 --> 00:05:28.037
that energy rightly
applied and directed...


00:05:28.070 --> 00:05:29.172
- Come in.


00:05:29.205 --> 00:05:31.173
Will
accomplish anything.


00:05:34.409 --> 00:05:37.344
- Nellie Bly I'd like to
introduce you to our publisher,


00:05:37.377 --> 00:05:39.714
Joseph Pulitzer.


00:05:41.881 --> 00:05:44.117
- It's very nice to
meet you Mr. Pulitzer.


00:05:44.150 --> 00:05:46.019
It is a great honor.


00:05:49.187 --> 00:05:50.923
- Bly is not your real name.


00:05:50.956 --> 00:05:53.791
- No, Nellie Bly is my pen name.


00:05:53.824 --> 00:05:54.859
- She is small.


00:05:54.892 --> 00:05:55.860
- But plucky.


00:05:55.893 --> 00:05:57.028
- Is that enough?


00:05:57.061 --> 00:05:58.795
- Her recommendation
is impeccable.


00:05:58.828 --> 00:05:59.896
Her reputation is outstanding.


00:05:59.929 --> 00:06:01.798
I believe she was made for this.


00:06:01.831 --> 00:06:02.999
- She is unknown.


00:06:03.032 --> 00:06:09.706
If this fails, it is not her
reputation that is on the line.


00:06:13.241 --> 00:06:16.276
- I would live to thank you
for the advance, Mr. Cokerill.


00:06:16.309 --> 00:06:18.312
I am ready for any opportunity
the World Newspaper


00:06:18.345 --> 00:06:20.114
has for me.


00:06:20.147 --> 00:06:21.814
- I've spoken with Mr. Pulitzer


00:06:21.847 --> 00:06:23.983
about some of the
ideas you suggested.


00:06:24.016 --> 00:06:25.485
- Oh.


00:06:25.518 --> 00:06:27.320
- Would you really have
gone up in a balloon?


00:06:27.353 --> 00:06:29.121
- Without question.


00:06:29.154 --> 00:06:32.090
You gave the assignment to
a male reporter instead,


00:06:32.123 --> 00:06:34.458
I would have drawn
greater sensation.


00:06:34.491 --> 00:06:37.194
- No doubt.


00:06:37.227 --> 00:06:40.363
But we have another idea,


00:06:40.396 --> 00:06:42.298
the World Newspaper would
like you to infiltrate


00:06:42.331 --> 00:06:47.002
one of the asylums for the
insane in New York City.


00:06:48.236 --> 00:06:50.105
- To report on the
treatment of the patients?


00:06:50.138 --> 00:06:51.539
- Yes.


00:06:51.572 --> 00:06:53.207
- Which asylum?


00:06:53.240 --> 00:06:57.944
- Blackwell's Island
Lunatic Asylum for Women.


00:06:57.977 --> 00:07:00.113
- To get in, I will
have to be committed.


00:07:00.146 --> 00:07:03.949
- We can find a doctor who'd
be willing to sign the papers.


00:07:03.982 --> 00:07:06.485
- No I'll have to do it myself.


00:07:06.518 --> 00:07:08.953
The only sure way
I am not revealed


00:07:08.986 --> 00:07:11.957
is absolutely everyone
must believe I am insane.


00:07:13.857 --> 00:07:17.261
How will you get me out
after I once get in?


00:07:17.294 --> 00:07:20.196
- I do not know.


00:07:20.229 --> 00:07:22.298
It will be quite dangerous.


00:07:22.331 --> 00:07:24.100
- I have faith in my abilities.


00:07:24.133 --> 00:07:25.901
- No doubt you have
faith in your abilities


00:07:25.934 --> 00:07:27.836
to deceive the insanity experts,


00:07:27.869 --> 00:07:30.539
I fear they cannot be deceived.


00:07:30.572 --> 00:07:32.973
- I will teach myself to be mad.


00:07:33.006 --> 00:07:35.276
- It is vital that
you not be revealed,


00:07:35.309 --> 00:07:37.410
your very life
may be threatened.


00:07:37.443 --> 00:07:39.145
- I am not afraid of danger.


00:07:39.178 --> 00:07:40.947
- And how do we truly
test the competency


00:07:40.980 --> 00:07:44.116
of the doctors and nurses.


00:07:44.149 --> 00:07:45.851
- The answer is simple,


00:07:45.884 --> 00:07:48.352
I will be insane long
enough to get committed,


00:07:48.385 --> 00:07:51.889
but from the moment I enter
the insane ward on the island,


00:07:51.922 --> 00:07:56.026
I will talk and act just
as I do in ordinary life.


00:07:58.161 --> 00:08:00.329
Then it is decided.


00:08:02.931 --> 00:08:05.034
- It is decided.


00:08:05.067 --> 00:08:07.569
- I shall feign insanity
have myself committed


00:08:07.602 --> 00:08:09.838
to Blackwell's Lunatic Asylum.


00:08:09.871 --> 00:08:11.572
Yes.


00:08:11.605 --> 00:08:13.574
Uh, just one more thing.


00:08:13.607 --> 00:08:14.975
- What is it?


00:08:15.008 --> 00:08:17.610
- I am afraid of that
chronic smile of yours.


00:08:17.643 --> 00:08:21.080
- I will smile no more.


00:08:30.554 --> 00:08:32.289
- After
receiving my instructions,


00:08:32.322 --> 00:08:33.924
I returned to my boarding house.


00:08:33.957 --> 00:08:35.124
And in front of the mirror,


00:08:35.157 --> 00:08:38.394
I began to practice the role
in which I was to make my debut


00:08:38.427 --> 00:08:41.564
to convince the world
that I was insane.


00:09:18.227 --> 00:09:19.996
I turned the gas up high,


00:09:20.029 --> 00:09:21.997
in hopes that it
would raise my courage


00:09:22.030 --> 00:09:23.899
against the thought that
I about to be locked away


00:09:23.932 --> 00:09:27.368
in a mad house, with no
clear way to get out.


00:09:50.687 --> 00:09:52.389
I quietly bathed fair well


00:09:52.422 --> 00:09:55.258
to the precious comforts
of modern civilization.


00:09:57.225 --> 00:09:59.128
It may be for days.


00:09:59.161 --> 00:10:01.129
It may be for longer.


00:10:01.162 --> 00:10:04.399
I took a last fond look
at myself as a sane woman.


00:10:04.432 --> 00:10:07.034
Who could tell, but that
the strain of playing crazy


00:10:07.067 --> 00:10:09.069
might burn my own brain


00:10:09.102 --> 00:10:11.338
and I would never get back.


00:10:15.174 --> 00:10:17.410
I decided to start my
mission at a temporary home


00:10:17.443 --> 00:10:20.412
for working women.


00:10:20.445 --> 00:10:22.547
My objective was to make
this house full of women


00:10:22.580 --> 00:10:24.281
believe me crazy,


00:10:24.314 --> 00:10:27.384
so they would never rest
until I was out of there reach


00:10:27.417 --> 00:10:30.053
and in secure quartets.


00:10:31.487 --> 00:10:33.523
- Well what do you want?


00:10:33.556 --> 00:10:35.657
- I want to stay
here for a few days,


00:10:35.690 --> 00:10:37.993
if you can accommodate me.


00:10:38.026 --> 00:10:40.429
- Well I have no single
rooms, we are so crowded.


00:10:40.462 --> 00:10:42.430
But if you will occupy a
room with another girl,


00:10:42.463 --> 00:10:43.631
I shall grant you that much.


00:10:43.664 --> 00:10:45.299
- I shall be glad of that.


00:10:45.332 --> 00:10:46.634
How much do you charge?


00:10:46.667 --> 00:10:50.337
- Thirty cents a night.


00:10:54.740 --> 00:10:59.611
Move along.


00:11:03.347 --> 00:11:06.049
So now I was
amongst these honest workers,


00:11:06.082 --> 00:11:07.718
the most deserving of women.


00:11:07.751 --> 00:11:10.686
I selected them as the ones
to work out my salvation,


00:11:10.719 --> 00:11:13.122
or more properly speaking,


00:11:13.155 --> 00:11:16.491
my condemnation and conviction
into the insane asylum.


00:11:23.497 --> 00:11:25.699
- Shhh.


00:11:25.732 --> 00:11:28.001
Shhh!


00:11:28.034 --> 00:11:28.768
Shhh!


00:11:46.049 --> 00:11:47.584
- What's wrong with you?


00:11:47.617 --> 00:11:49.419
Have you some
sorrow or troubled?


00:11:49.452 --> 00:11:51.453
- No why?


00:11:51.486 --> 00:11:55.457
- Oh because I can
see it in your face.


00:11:55.490 --> 00:11:59.127
What kind of work are
you trying to get?


00:12:00.661 --> 00:12:03.363
- I never worked,
I don't know how.


00:12:03.396 --> 00:12:06.567
- But you must learn,
all these women work.


00:12:08.133 --> 00:12:11.203
- Do they?


00:12:11.236 --> 00:12:14.672
Oh why they all
look horrible to me.


00:12:14.705 --> 00:12:19.209
Just like crazy women.


00:12:19.242 --> 00:12:22.279
There's so many
crazy people about.


00:12:29.618 --> 00:12:31.219
It
was amusing to see


00:12:31.252 --> 00:12:33.388
what remarkably short time it
took to get up from her chair


00:12:33.421 --> 00:12:36.223
and hurriedly move away
from the crazy girl.


00:12:36.256 --> 00:12:37.658
I knew my performance
had hit home.


00:12:51.536 --> 00:12:53.272
- So I said to the supervisor,


00:12:53.305 --> 00:12:55.640
that it's just not right
to keep this place so cold.


00:12:55.673 --> 00:12:58.142
I mean if they want
us to produce faster,


00:12:58.175 --> 00:13:00.143
they really ought to invest
in a couple sticks of wood


00:13:00.176 --> 00:13:03.547
for the stove, don't you agree?


00:13:03.580 --> 00:13:06.549
- I don't know, I cannot say.


00:13:06.582 --> 00:13:10.720
Oh yes, I mean no, I don't know.


00:13:11.686 --> 00:13:14.689
Oh is it suddenly hot in here?


00:13:14.722 --> 00:13:17.691
I know nothing about
the boats to Boston.


00:13:17.724 --> 00:13:20.160
I have to find my trunks!


00:13:20.193 --> 00:13:22.562
- It's time for bed ladies.


00:13:23.629 --> 00:13:25.164
- Oh I'm afraid.


00:13:25.197 --> 00:13:26.299
Can I not sit by
the stairs tonight?


00:13:26.332 --> 00:13:27.667
- No!


00:13:29.501 --> 00:13:35.239
Everyone in the house will
think that you're crazy.


00:13:39.510 --> 00:13:40.510
- This way Miss Brown.


00:13:40.543 --> 00:13:44.114
- No, this is my room.


00:13:44.147 --> 00:13:45.814
I will not stay with
that crazy woman


00:13:45.847 --> 00:13:47.783
for all the money
in the Vanderbelts.


00:13:47.816 --> 00:13:49.585
My
act was working.


00:13:49.618 --> 00:13:52.720
The women were afraid of me.


00:13:52.753 --> 00:13:54.622
- I can't have her
scaring you all off.


00:13:54.655 --> 00:13:55.656
I'll send for a policeman


00:13:55.689 --> 00:13:57.224
and have her taken away at once.


00:13:57.257 --> 00:13:59.226
Go fetch a policeman
from the corner.


00:13:59.259 --> 00:14:01.728
- No she can stay in my room.


00:14:01.761 --> 00:14:04.396
- There's only one bed, I don't
have time to set up another.


00:14:04.429 --> 00:14:05.731
- That'll be fine.


00:14:05.764 --> 00:14:07.233
- Only this
one woman among the crowd,


00:14:07.266 --> 00:14:08.633
pretty and delicate
Mrs. Caine...


00:14:08.666 --> 00:14:10.168
- Suit yourself.


00:14:10.201 --> 00:14:15.506
- Displayed
true compassionate feeling.


00:14:19.809 --> 00:14:21.410
She smoothed my hair


00:14:21.443 --> 00:14:23.679
and talked as soothingly
to me as a mother would do


00:14:23.712 --> 00:14:24.881
to a sick child.


00:14:24.914 --> 00:14:27.682
- I don't remember
much about my mother,


00:14:27.715 --> 00:14:32.486
but I always remember her
combing through my hair


00:14:32.519 --> 00:14:35.323
and getting me ready for bed.


00:14:38.891 --> 00:14:40.793
Let's get you out of that
dress and ready for bed.


00:14:40.826 --> 00:14:42.462
- No!


00:14:44.362 --> 00:14:45.697
They're going to kill me.


00:14:45.730 --> 00:14:47.900
- Who's going to kill you?


00:14:47.933 --> 00:14:49.333
- I will not take off my dress.


00:14:49.366 --> 00:14:50.635
- Perhaps if you just
lie down on the bed


00:14:50.668 --> 00:14:51.636
with your clothes on...


00:14:51.669 --> 00:14:52.804
- No!


00:14:54.537 --> 00:14:56.773
- Here look, I will
lie down on the bed


00:14:56.806 --> 00:14:59.276
with my clothes on as
well, be ready with you.


00:14:59.309 --> 00:15:03.813
- I will not.


00:15:08.282 --> 00:15:12.686
- Do try to rest dear.


00:15:30.534 --> 00:15:35.371
- You're still awake,
lively as a cricket.


00:15:35.404 --> 00:15:38.241
- I have to find my luggage.


00:15:38.274 --> 00:15:39.842
- Oh dear, you have been
up on your feet all night,


00:15:39.875 --> 00:15:41.476
you must be exhausted.


00:15:41.509 --> 00:15:44.279
Though Mrs. Caine
grew more and more anxious..


00:15:44.312 --> 00:15:45.747
- Sit and rest poor thing.


00:15:45.780 --> 00:15:49.550
She was
as sympathetic as ever.


00:15:49.583 --> 00:15:52.552
Poor soul, how cruelly
I tortured her.


00:15:52.585 --> 00:15:54.287
- I have trunks.


00:15:54.320 --> 00:15:56.289
Where are they? I want them.


00:15:56.322 --> 00:15:57.490
I want them.


00:15:57.523 --> 00:16:00.426
And what
a kind heart she had.


00:16:00.459 --> 00:16:02.261
- I'll see if there's
any more of them.


00:16:16.605 --> 00:16:19.642
- How much I admired
her courage and kindness,


00:16:19.675 --> 00:16:20.843
how I longed to reassure her


00:16:20.876 --> 00:16:23.812
and whisper that
I was not insane.


00:16:23.845 --> 00:16:25.880
How I hoped that
if any poor girl


00:16:25.913 --> 00:16:27.715
should ever be so
unfortunate as to be


00:16:27.748 --> 00:16:29.350
what I was pretending to be...


00:16:29.383 --> 00:16:30.484
- Poor child.


00:16:30.517 --> 00:16:31.685
She
might meet with one


00:16:31.718 --> 00:16:34.420
who possessed the same
spirit of human kindness


00:16:34.453 --> 00:16:35.889
as Mrs. Ruth Caine.


00:16:38.490 --> 00:16:42.394
- Yes I believe the
poor dear is insane.


00:16:51.567 --> 00:16:52.869
- I want you to
take her quietly.


00:16:52.902 --> 00:16:54.604
- If she don't go quietly,


00:16:54.637 --> 00:16:55.971
I will drag her
through the streets.


00:16:56.004 --> 00:16:58.707
- I certainly wish to avoid
raising a scandal outside.


00:16:58.740 --> 00:17:00.409
- There's no need for
that kind of brutality.


00:17:00.442 --> 00:17:01.876
- I'll handle this.


00:17:01.909 --> 00:17:04.646
We'll take her along quietly.


00:17:05.613 --> 00:17:07.514
Well hello there sweet girl.


00:17:07.547 --> 00:17:08.749
If you would like
to come with me,


00:17:08.782 --> 00:17:11.351
I'll help you find
your lost effects.


00:17:11.384 --> 00:17:12.653
- Who are you?


00:17:12.686 --> 00:17:13.886
I don't know you.


00:17:13.919 --> 00:17:15.655
- He's a policeman love.


00:17:15.688 --> 00:17:16.822
He means you no harm,


00:17:16.855 --> 00:17:19.491
he's going to help
you find your things.


00:17:19.524 --> 00:17:21.993
- I don't want to
go with him alone.


00:17:22.026 --> 00:17:23.528
I do not know him.


00:17:23.561 --> 00:17:25.496
- You don't have to go with
him if you don't want to.


00:17:25.529 --> 00:17:27.598
- I will help you
find your trunks.


00:17:27.631 --> 00:17:30.034
We can find them together.


00:17:30.066 --> 00:17:31.501
- You will?


00:17:31.534 --> 00:17:33.603
- Of course, they couldn't
have got very far.


00:17:33.636 --> 00:17:34.671
Now you just come along with me.


00:17:43.677 --> 00:17:45.913
Follow us at a
respectable distance.


00:17:45.946 --> 00:17:52.519
- These policeman
are here to help you.


00:18:00.424 --> 00:18:02.060
The
skies were overcast


00:18:02.093 --> 00:18:05.062
as I was taken to the
S6 Market Police Court.


00:18:05.095 --> 00:18:07.597
Where at last, the
question of my sanity,


00:18:07.630 --> 00:18:10.433
or insanity was to be decided.


00:18:10.466 --> 00:18:12.335
- Sir, sir, please help me sir.


00:18:12.368 --> 00:18:13.436
- Step back.


00:18:13.469 --> 00:18:15.338
- Here's the express house.


00:18:15.371 --> 00:18:17.639
We're all here to help
you find your trunks.


00:18:17.672 --> 00:18:20.008
- All these people
lost their trunks?


00:18:20.041 --> 00:18:22.676
- Yes apparently all of
them have lost their trunks.


00:18:22.709 --> 00:18:24.545
- I don't know what
to do with the child.


00:18:24.578 --> 00:18:25.813
She must be taken care of.


00:18:25.846 --> 00:18:26.780
Send
her to the island.


00:18:26.813 --> 00:18:28.815
- No, oh don't, don't.


00:18:28.848 --> 00:18:32.018
She is a lady, it would kill
her to go to the island.


00:18:32.051 --> 00:18:33.719
- Perhaps you're right.


00:18:33.752 --> 00:18:36.088
There is some foul work here,


00:18:36.121 --> 00:18:40.524
I believe this girl has been
drugged and brought to the city


00:18:40.557 --> 00:18:41.826
make out the papers,


00:18:41.859 --> 00:18:44.562
we'll send her to
Belview for examination.


00:18:44.595 --> 00:18:45.995
And probably in a few days,


00:18:46.028 --> 00:18:47.630
the effect of the
drug will wear off


00:18:47.663 --> 00:18:50.633
and she'll be able to tell us
a story that'll be startling.


00:18:50.666 --> 00:18:53.836
- I do not wish to stay here
any longer to be gazed at.


00:18:53.869 --> 00:18:58.740
- Take her to my office.


00:19:03.009 --> 00:19:05.445
- Put out your tongue.


00:19:06.813 --> 00:19:08.581
I said put out your tongue.


00:19:08.614 --> 00:19:09.882
- I don't want to.


00:19:09.915 --> 00:19:11.650
- But you are sick
and I am a doctor.


00:19:11.683 --> 00:19:16.021
- I am not sick, I
just want my trunks.


00:19:20.724 --> 00:19:27.997
- Open.


00:19:32.500 --> 00:19:33.735
Take a deep breath.


00:19:43.509 --> 00:19:44.744
Alright.


00:19:44.777 --> 00:19:46.613
Look at my hand.


00:19:49.681 --> 00:19:52.017
Follow my hand.


00:19:52.050 --> 00:19:56.688
And again.


00:20:00.657 --> 00:20:01.992
I believe she's
taken Belladonna.


00:20:02.025 --> 00:20:03.794
- I'm not in the least ill.


00:20:03.827 --> 00:20:05.995
I've never been sick and no
one has the right to detain me


00:20:06.028 --> 00:20:08.931
when I want to find my trunks.


00:20:08.964 --> 00:20:10.433
I want to go home.


00:20:10.466 --> 00:20:12.901
- And I will take you home.


00:20:14.802 --> 00:20:16.905
- I am so glad to go with you.


00:20:16.938 --> 00:20:18.505
I began
to have more confidence


00:20:18.538 --> 00:20:20.908
in my own ability to
play a mad woman now,


00:20:20.941 --> 00:20:23.776
since one judge, one
doctor, and a mass of people


00:20:23.809 --> 00:20:25.812
had pronounced me insane.


00:20:29.981 --> 00:20:31.483
I shall never forget that ride


00:20:31.516 --> 00:20:33.685
to the insane pavilion
at Belview Hospital.


00:20:35.752 --> 00:20:37.788
It was at the hospital
that I was to be processed


00:20:37.821 --> 00:20:40.523
and my fate sealed
regarding my commitment


00:20:40.556 --> 00:20:42.526
to Blackwell's Island Asylum.


00:20:44.193 --> 00:20:46.595
- This girl is to wait here.


00:20:49.965 --> 00:20:51.633
- Oh please do not go.


00:20:51.666 --> 00:20:54.469
Please do not leave
me here, I beg you.


00:20:54.502 --> 00:20:56.838
Oh take me with you.


00:20:56.871 --> 00:20:58.939
You said that you
would take me home.


00:20:58.972 --> 00:21:02.776
- I have to assist
with an amputation.


00:21:05.244 --> 00:21:07.547
- Those noisy commoners.


00:21:11.015 --> 00:21:13.051
- I do not want to
stay here without you.


00:21:13.084 --> 00:21:14.586
- I'll be back soon, I promise.


00:21:14.619 --> 00:21:16.119
- To take me home?


00:21:16.152 --> 00:21:17.554
- Yes.


00:21:17.587 --> 00:21:19.223
At last, I
found myself an occupant


00:21:19.256 --> 00:21:21.090
of an insane asylum.


00:21:23.659 --> 00:21:26.595
I already felt like
a woman condemned.


00:21:28.530 --> 00:21:31.733
- Hello, I'd like
to introduce myself.


00:21:31.766 --> 00:21:33.935
My name is Nellie Brown.


00:21:37.604 --> 00:21:39.239
I'm here waiting for
a nice gentleman,


00:21:39.272 --> 00:21:44.743
who is going to
come take me home.


00:21:49.047 --> 00:21:53.485
- I'm Ann Neville.


00:21:57.020 --> 00:21:59.990
This is not a place
that you want wait long,


00:22:00.023 --> 00:22:02.825
if you don't need to be here.


00:22:02.858 --> 00:22:05.728
This is a place of the sick.


00:22:05.761 --> 00:22:07.862
- Are you sick?


00:22:07.895 --> 00:22:09.197
- Yes.


00:22:13.233 --> 00:22:15.168
- How did you come to be here?


00:22:15.201 --> 00:22:19.138
- I was working as a chamber
maid in a large house,


00:22:19.171 --> 00:22:20.940
when my health gave away.


00:22:20.973 --> 00:22:24.042
I was sent to a sister's
home to be treated.


00:22:24.075 --> 00:22:27.012
My nephew is out of work.


00:22:27.045 --> 00:22:30.581
Being unable to pay my
expenses at my home,


00:22:30.614 --> 00:22:33.551
he had me transferred
here to Belview.


00:22:41.157 --> 00:22:43.892
- Is there anything
wrong with you mentally?


00:22:43.925 --> 00:22:45.294
- No.


00:22:46.861 --> 00:22:50.131
The doctors have been asking
me many dubious questions


00:22:50.164 --> 00:22:52.199
and confusing me,


00:22:52.232 --> 00:22:56.069
but there's nothing
wrong with my brain.


00:22:56.102 --> 00:22:57.837
- Do you know that
only insane people


00:22:57.870 --> 00:22:58.904
are sent to this pavilion?


00:22:58.937 --> 00:23:02.775
- Yes, I know.


00:23:02.808 --> 00:23:05.243
But the doctors refuse
to listen to me,


00:23:05.276 --> 00:23:08.680
it's useless to say
anything to the nurses.


00:23:12.949 --> 00:23:15.185
- Let me hold the baby.


00:23:52.348 --> 00:23:54.184
- Nellie Brown,
the doctor is here.


00:23:54.217 --> 00:23:56.319
He wishes to speak with you.


00:24:00.122 --> 00:24:01.990
- How are you feeling Nellie?


00:24:03.424 --> 00:24:07.061
- Oh I feel alright.


00:24:07.094 --> 00:24:09.663
But you
are sick you know?


00:24:09.696 --> 00:24:10.330
- Am I?


00:24:10.363 --> 00:24:11.932
- Yes.


00:24:11.965 --> 00:24:14.066
Tell me why did you think the
women in the temporary home


00:24:14.099 --> 00:24:15.301
were going to harm you.


00:24:15.334 --> 00:24:17.737
- Temporary home, I...


00:24:17.770 --> 00:24:19.204
What temporary home?


00:24:19.237 --> 00:24:20.805
- You did not stay in a temporary home for working women?


00:24:20.838 --> 00:24:23.808
- No, I've never
stayed in such a place.


00:24:23.841 --> 00:24:25.843
- What was the name of the
judge presiding over your case?


00:24:25.876 --> 00:24:28.345
- I do not remember going
in front of a judge.


00:24:28.378 --> 00:24:31.381
- I see, what is
your father's name?


00:24:35.418 --> 00:24:37.219
- I cannot remember.


00:24:37.252 --> 00:24:38.988
- What is your mother's name?


00:24:41.990 --> 00:24:43.224
- I cannot remember.


00:24:43.257 --> 00:24:46.093
- Any brothers or
sisters, aunts or uncles?


00:24:46.126 --> 00:24:47.228
- I cannot remember.


00:24:47.261 --> 00:24:49.095
- Calm down Miss
Brown, calm down.


00:24:49.128 --> 00:24:50.931
It's fine.


00:24:52.932 --> 00:24:57.036
Do you not have a lover
that casts you aside?


00:24:57.069 --> 00:24:58.237
- No.


00:24:58.270 --> 00:24:59.238
- Now what street was
the temporary home,


00:24:59.271 --> 00:25:00.938
you stayed at, located?


00:25:00.971 --> 00:25:03.274
- I did not stay at
any temporary home!


00:25:03.307 --> 00:25:05.375
- Alright, that's
fine Miss Brown.


00:25:05.408 --> 00:25:08.078
Try to get some rest, alright.


00:25:12.347 --> 00:25:13.416
Not once,


00:25:13.449 --> 00:25:14.817
did it cross the
admitting doctor's mind


00:25:14.850 --> 00:25:16.751
that I might not be
telling him the truth.


00:25:16.784 --> 00:25:18.253
Based on such an examination,


00:25:18.286 --> 00:25:19.754
I doubt any doctor could tell


00:25:19.787 --> 00:25:22.257
whether people
are insane or not.


00:25:37.135 --> 00:25:39.271
- Ow, ah!


00:25:39.304 --> 00:25:42.406
Ow, ow, you are trimming
my nails to the quick.


00:25:42.439 --> 00:25:45.109
- It is for everyone's safety.


00:25:46.976 --> 00:25:48.478
- Miss Scott, Miss Scott,


00:25:48.511 --> 00:25:50.880
there's a gentleman here
from the Sun Newspaper


00:25:50.913 --> 00:25:52.214
to interview Miss Brown.


00:25:52.247 --> 00:25:55.150
- No one is to see
the transfer patients.


00:25:55.183 --> 00:25:57.218
- I had to
summon all of my courage,


00:25:57.251 --> 00:26:00.788
as I was marched to the
boat to Blackwell's Asylum;


00:26:00.821 --> 00:26:04.324
an insane place, where
women never get out.


00:26:40.954 --> 00:26:46.359
- Come with me.


00:26:54.166 --> 00:26:56.934
- Feet flat on the
floor at all times.


00:27:06.842 --> 00:27:09.178
- Voiceover] It's strange
how after all of my bravery,


00:27:09.211 --> 00:27:11.947
I felt a chill at being locked
up with fellow creatures,


00:27:11.980 --> 00:27:13.815
who were truly insane.


00:27:13.848 --> 00:27:20.521
Come here to bed.


00:27:24.924 --> 00:27:27.493
- I had recently been ill.


00:27:27.526 --> 00:27:30.495
It lasted so long, I suffered
from nervous stability.


00:27:30.528 --> 00:27:34.166
But I only had fever
thinking, while I was ill.


00:27:35.532 --> 00:27:37.434
I do not belong here.


00:27:37.467 --> 00:27:39.837
I have recovered.


00:27:39.870 --> 00:27:42.972
- I will decide your diagnosis.


00:27:43.005 --> 00:27:44.374
- Please,


00:27:44.407 --> 00:27:47.876
try all your tests for
insanity if you have any,


00:27:47.909 --> 00:27:49.545
I do not belong here.


00:27:49.578 --> 00:27:51.413
- Everyone who enters
here makes that claim.


00:27:51.446 --> 00:27:53.514
- Please give me justice.


00:27:53.547 --> 00:27:55.516
- Justice?


00:27:55.549 --> 00:27:57.251
- Justice refers to the law,


00:27:57.284 --> 00:28:00.854
you speak as if you're
entering a prison.


00:28:00.887 --> 00:28:02.856
But this is a hospital,


00:28:02.889 --> 00:28:04.323
we're here to help you.


00:28:04.356 --> 00:28:06.926
- Please, I beg you.


00:28:06.959 --> 00:28:08.994
You not need worry Miss Mayard,


00:28:09.027 --> 00:28:11.963
we'll get you the help you need.


00:28:18.268 --> 00:28:20.003
- I'm so frightened.


00:28:20.036 --> 00:28:21.337
He didn't listen to me at all.


00:28:21.370 --> 00:28:23.005
Mrs. Louise Shanz.


00:28:23.038 --> 00:28:26.142
- I will try by every means
to be a benefit to you.


00:28:26.175 --> 00:28:28.911
- What can you do?


00:28:31.379 --> 00:28:33.514
- Doctor please, you do
not understand what...


00:28:33.547 --> 00:28:37.284
You're name?


00:28:39.986 --> 00:28:42.455
- Miss Grupe, you're German.


00:28:42.488 --> 00:28:45.825
Ask her what her husband does.


00:28:52.096 --> 00:28:56.900
- Her husband is a craftsman.


00:28:58.034 --> 00:28:59.336
- Very well.


00:28:59.369 --> 00:29:01.037
Mrs. Louise Schanz is admitted


00:29:01.070 --> 00:29:02.171
to Blackwell's
Island Insane Asylum.


00:29:02.204 --> 00:29:04.139
- No this is not right.


00:29:17.217 --> 00:29:18.519
- Miss Anne Neville.


00:29:19.652 --> 00:29:21.487
- Can you tell me your name?


00:29:21.520 --> 00:29:23.189
- Yes.


00:29:24.989 --> 00:29:25.924
- What is it?


00:29:25.957 --> 00:29:30.294
- You don't know or are
you seeing if I know?


00:29:33.664 --> 00:29:35.466
What are you writing?


00:29:35.499 --> 00:29:36.900
- I ask the questions.


00:29:36.933 --> 00:29:38.301
Like the others,


00:29:38.334 --> 00:29:41.638
the poor girl was condemned
to the insane asylum for life.


00:29:41.671 --> 00:29:43.138
- Anne Neville.


00:29:43.171 --> 00:29:44.106
- Without being
given one feeble chance


00:29:44.139 --> 00:29:45.274
to prove her sanity.


00:29:45.307 --> 00:29:48.376
- Nellie Brown the
doctor wants you.


00:29:48.409 --> 00:29:50.378
- As
according to my plan,


00:29:50.411 --> 00:29:52.313
the moment I
entered Blackwell's,


00:29:52.346 --> 00:29:54.514
I dropped my act of insanity


00:29:54.547 --> 00:29:57.050
and acted just as I
do in every day life.


00:29:57.083 --> 00:29:58.585
What is your name?


00:29:58.618 --> 00:30:00.553
- Nellie Brown.


00:30:02.554 --> 00:30:04.923
- What's the color of her eyes?


00:30:04.956 --> 00:30:06.258
- Gray.


00:30:07.158 --> 00:30:09.027
What is your age?


00:30:09.060 --> 00:30:11.495
- Nineteen last may.


00:30:14.564 --> 00:30:16.599
- When do you get
your next pass?


00:30:16.632 --> 00:30:19.001
- Next Saturday is
my next day off.


00:30:19.034 --> 00:30:20.269
- You will go into town?


00:30:20.302 --> 00:30:23.338
Yeah.


00:30:23.371 --> 00:30:28.542
- Measure her.


00:30:33.146 --> 00:30:34.915
What is it?


00:30:37.650 --> 00:30:39.352
- Now you know I can't tell.


00:30:39.385 --> 00:30:41.420
- Yes you can, now
look and tell me.


00:30:41.453 --> 00:30:43.522
- I can't, do it yourself.


00:30:55.732 --> 00:30:58.400
- Five feet, five inches.


00:30:58.433 --> 00:31:01.036
Don't you see?


00:31:01.069 --> 00:31:04.572
- Oh yeah, I see now.


00:31:08.209 --> 00:31:10.077
- Now...


00:31:12.579 --> 00:31:15.548
That will do, I'm
finished with her.


00:31:18.684 --> 00:31:21.519
- I am not sick and I do
not want to stay here.


00:31:21.552 --> 00:31:23.188
- That'll do Miss Gruper.


00:31:23.221 --> 00:31:26.056
- No one has a right to
shut me up in this manner.


00:31:32.428 --> 00:31:34.965
- Bath time single file!


00:31:35.464 --> 00:31:36.766
Girl undress.


00:31:36.799 --> 00:31:38.500
- I think I shall not.


00:31:38.533 --> 00:31:41.036
I've never bathed in this
manner in front of others.


00:31:41.069 --> 00:31:43.504
And it is too cold
to bathe tonight.


00:31:43.537 --> 00:31:46.073
Why can't we wait until
day time when it is warm?


00:31:46.106 --> 00:31:48.742
- Nellie Brown, either you
remove your clothing right now


00:31:48.775 --> 00:31:51.211
or we will undress you.


00:31:55.080 --> 00:31:56.548
Very well.


00:31:56.581 --> 00:32:01.052
Miss Grupe.


00:32:13.162 --> 00:32:15.665
- No, no.


00:32:20.134 --> 00:32:24.372
I will not remove it.


00:32:29.075 --> 00:32:30.677
No.


00:32:46.189 --> 00:32:48.458
It's so cold, I cannot stand it.


00:32:51.160 --> 00:32:53.696
No, no my hair,
please no my hair.


00:33:22.619 --> 00:33:24.188
- Next.


00:33:25.789 --> 00:33:27.824
I'm ill, I
have been sick with a cough.


00:33:27.857 --> 00:33:31.428
My chest, I cannot
get into cold water.


00:33:41.235 --> 00:33:42.536
- Can no one hear her?


00:33:42.569 --> 00:33:45.738
She's ill, she's not well
enough for cold water.


00:33:45.771 --> 00:33:48.842
- Please,
please my head is been hurt.


00:33:48.875 --> 00:33:51.610
My hair is falling out.


00:33:55.779 --> 00:33:57.281
- May I have a nightgown?


00:33:57.314 --> 00:33:59.550
- We have not such things
in this institution.


00:33:59.583 --> 00:34:00.785
- I'm still wet from the bath


00:34:00.818 --> 00:34:02.452
and I shouldn't like
to sleep without one.


00:34:02.485 --> 00:34:03.787
- This is charity


00:34:03.820 --> 00:34:05.689
and you should be
thankful for what you get.


00:34:05.722 --> 00:34:08.390
- But the city pays to
keep these places up


00:34:08.423 --> 00:34:11.494
and pays people to be kind to
the unfortunates brought here.


00:34:11.527 --> 00:34:14.729
- Well you don't need to
expect any kindness here,


00:34:14.762 --> 00:34:17.565
for you won't get it.


00:34:33.444 --> 00:34:35.780
- Brown, get up.


00:34:36.413 --> 00:34:37.348
Drink this.


00:34:37.381 --> 00:34:38.549
- What is it?


00:34:38.582 --> 00:34:40.184
- It's something
to help you sleep.


00:34:40.217 --> 00:34:40.851
- What's in it?


00:34:40.884 --> 00:34:42.652
- It's Laudannum.


00:34:42.685 --> 00:34:44.621
- Is that not an opium mixture?


00:34:44.654 --> 00:34:46.523
- Yes it
will help you sleep.


00:34:46.556 --> 00:34:47.723
- I'm not going to take opium.


00:34:47.756 --> 00:34:49.625
- The doctor has ordered
it, you must take it.


00:34:49.658 --> 00:34:53.128
- I will do nothing of the sort.


00:34:53.661 --> 00:34:54.896
- Hello Miss Brown.


00:34:54.929 --> 00:34:57.532
Refusing your medication?


00:34:57.565 --> 00:35:00.634
- It is opium, I do
not wish to take opium.


00:35:00.667 --> 00:35:02.502
- Nearly all the
patients take it.


00:35:02.535 --> 00:35:04.503
- I'm not going to take it.


00:35:04.536 --> 00:35:07.439
I do not intend to lose my
wits, even for a few hours.


00:35:07.472 --> 00:35:08.607
- If you do not take it,


00:35:08.640 --> 00:35:14.513
I will put it in your
arm with a needle.


00:35:18.782 --> 00:35:19.850
- This smells horrible.


00:35:19.883 --> 00:35:21.784
- I insist you drink
it all the same.


00:35:45.704 --> 00:35:47.406
- I thought
of Robert Bruce,


00:35:47.439 --> 00:35:49.274
the warrior who led
Scotland during the wars


00:35:49.307 --> 00:35:50.775
of independence.


00:35:50.808 --> 00:35:53.678
In his captivity, he found
confidence from a spider


00:35:53.711 --> 00:35:55.479
building her web across
the roof of his cell,


00:35:56.512 --> 00:36:00.817
undeterred by failure.


00:36:09.824 --> 00:36:11.193
- She's quite mad.


00:36:39.649 --> 00:36:42.684
- You may have my bread.


00:36:42.717 --> 00:36:46.855
- Thank you kindly, but
I will ask the nurse.


00:36:46.888 --> 00:36:50.325
- Excuse me may I have
a second piece of bread.


00:36:52.426 --> 00:36:53.527
- You have forgotten
where your home is,


00:36:53.560 --> 00:36:56.863
but you have not
forgotten how to eat.


00:36:56.896 --> 00:36:57.831
- Thank you.


00:37:16.413 --> 00:37:17.647
- Give me that.


00:37:19.048 --> 00:37:19.915
- To have a good mind,


00:37:19.948 --> 00:37:21.484
the stomach must be fed.


00:37:21.517 --> 00:37:23.518
- I cannot eat this stuff.


00:37:25.687 --> 00:37:28.822
- Patients wait
and transfer here,


00:37:28.855 --> 00:37:32.593
such as these, until the
staff can be allocated


00:37:32.626 --> 00:37:36.729
to move them onto
their daily activities.


00:37:36.762 --> 00:37:39.065
- When was Blackwell's
first opened?


00:37:39.098 --> 00:37:42.601
- The facility
was opened in 1839


00:37:42.634 --> 00:37:45.304
and quickly overrun
with patients.


00:37:45.337 --> 00:37:49.840
It has been in continuous
operations since then.


00:37:49.873 --> 00:37:52.909
Blackwell's was designed
by the faint architect,


00:37:52.942 --> 00:37:56.079
Alexander Jackson Davis.


00:37:56.112 --> 00:37:58.847
The facility was
constructed of granite,


00:37:58.880 --> 00:38:02.484
reflecting a feudal
style of architecture,


00:38:02.517 --> 00:38:04.752
with it's more than
large appearance.


00:38:04.785 --> 00:38:08.656
It's stands 600 feet long.


00:38:08.689 --> 00:38:11.825
Wit the proper
funding and guidance,


00:38:11.858 --> 00:38:15.528
Blackwell"s will one
day be a Utopian example


00:38:15.561 --> 00:38:19.665
of the most advanced
treatment of the insane.


00:38:19.698 --> 00:38:21.466
We have worked miracles


00:38:21.499 --> 00:38:24.803
with limited funding
available to us.


00:38:25.804 --> 00:38:29.073
Now you can see why we
need additional funding.


00:38:29.106 --> 00:38:32.709
Gentleman, please come this way.


00:38:36.679 --> 00:38:38.647
The
snow came early,


00:38:38.680 --> 00:38:40.615
many windows in the
hall were broken,


00:38:40.648 --> 00:38:43.385
and the bitter cold
air was unbearable.


00:38:43.417 --> 00:38:44.885
There was no heat.


00:38:44.918 --> 00:38:47.822
The nurses said it was one of
the rules of the institution,


00:38:47.855 --> 00:38:50.757
not to turn the heat
on until October


00:38:50.790 --> 00:38:52.625
and so we would
have to endure it,


00:38:52.658 --> 00:38:55.861
as the steam pipes had not
even been put in order.


00:38:59.498 --> 00:39:01.799
- How did you sleep
after your cold bath?


00:39:01.832 --> 00:39:03.768
- I almost froze


00:39:03.801 --> 00:39:07.804
and then the noise kept
me awake, it's dreadful.


00:39:07.837 --> 00:39:10.574
My nerves were so unstrung
before I came here


00:39:10.607 --> 00:39:14.009
and I fear I shall not be
able to stand the strain.


00:39:14.042 --> 00:39:16.045
- You must keep your spirits up.


00:39:16.078 --> 00:39:18.113
You never know what is to come.


00:39:18.146 --> 00:39:19.814
And if you give up now,


00:39:19.847 --> 00:39:22.484
the good may arrive and
you will not know it.


00:39:22.517 --> 00:39:23.917
- You are right of course.


00:39:23.950 --> 00:39:25.152
- Miss Tillie
Mayard suffered more


00:39:25.185 --> 00:39:27.521
than any of us from the cold.


00:39:27.554 --> 00:39:30.456
I asked the nurses that we
given additional clothing,


00:39:30.489 --> 00:39:31.991
but they told me to shut up.


00:39:32.024 --> 00:39:34.394
That we had as much as
they intended to give us.


00:39:34.427 --> 00:39:36.995
- Matilda I'll tell you
who has taken your money.


00:39:37.028 --> 00:39:39.064
- Who then, who do
you say has my money?


00:39:39.097 --> 00:39:45.837
- Come close and I'll tell you.


00:39:50.206 --> 00:39:51.608
- Who then, who?


00:39:51.641 --> 00:39:53.008
Please tell me so I
can collect my money


00:39:53.041 --> 00:39:54.843
and pay my way
out of this place.


00:39:54.876 --> 00:39:56.412
- It is Nurse Grupe.


00:39:56.445 --> 00:39:58.913
You must go to her and tell
her she is a thieving whore


00:39:58.946 --> 00:40:00.148
and you want your money


00:40:00.181 --> 00:40:02.850
or you will gouge her eyes out.


00:40:02.883 --> 00:40:06.019
Go to her, go, go
now and tell her.


00:40:09.622 --> 00:40:10.423
- Miss Grupe?


00:40:10.456 --> 00:40:12.024
- Yes Matilda?


00:40:12.057 --> 00:40:16.961
- Miss Grady says that
she is a thieving whore.


00:40:22.065 --> 00:40:23.500
- Matilda!


00:40:23.533 --> 00:40:25.770
Come here to me.


00:40:32.907 --> 00:40:36.912
Now return to your radiator.


00:40:36.945 --> 00:40:39.013
The lawyers that
stole your estate


00:40:39.046 --> 00:40:42.550
are in there waiting for
you to give them a piece


00:40:42.583 --> 00:40:44.085
of your mind.


00:41:08.036 --> 00:41:10.940
- I miss my son.


00:41:14.675 --> 00:41:19.713
I miss the way his hair would
smell sweet after a bath.


00:41:19.746 --> 00:41:24.218
I miss the way his
tiny hand wrapped


00:41:24.251 --> 00:41:26.953
around my finger.


00:41:28.521 --> 00:41:30.755
I have
watched patients stand


00:41:30.788 --> 00:41:33.024
and gaze longingly
towards the city bay


00:41:33.057 --> 00:41:35.961
and all likelihood
will never enter again.


00:41:35.994 --> 00:41:39.563
- Miss Fox, get away
from the window.


00:41:39.596 --> 00:41:41.799
There's nothing
out there for you.


00:41:41.832 --> 00:41:43.666
- That I am sure.


00:41:43.699 --> 00:41:45.201
- It means
liberty and life,


00:41:45.234 --> 00:41:47.203
it seems so near


00:41:47.236 --> 00:41:49.671
and yet heaven is not
further from hell.


00:41:49.704 --> 00:41:52.007
- Put out your tongue.


00:41:55.175 --> 00:41:57.912
Hold out your wrists.


00:42:02.282 --> 00:42:03.683
Look at my hand.


00:42:03.716 --> 00:42:05.518
- I have done this
again and again.


00:42:05.551 --> 00:42:08.855
- Look at my hand.


00:42:11.689 --> 00:42:13.558
Stretch out your arms
and work your fingers.


00:42:13.591 --> 00:42:14.692
- Surely by now you
have the results


00:42:14.725 --> 00:42:16.094
of such test
written down some...


00:42:18.128 --> 00:42:21.866
- Now stretch out your
arms and work your fingers.


00:42:25.701 --> 00:42:28.169
- What a
mysterious thing madness is.


00:42:28.202 --> 00:42:30.705
I have watched patients
whose lips are forever sealed


00:42:30.738 --> 00:42:32.974
in a perpetual silence.


00:42:33.007 --> 00:42:36.076
They breathe, eat, the
human form is there,


00:42:36.109 --> 00:42:39.746
but that something which
cannot exist without the body


00:42:39.779 --> 00:42:40.847
is missing.


00:42:40.880 --> 00:42:43.716
- Who sent you here?


00:42:43.749 --> 00:42:45.651
- The doctors.


00:42:45.684 --> 00:42:48.153
- For what?


00:42:48.186 --> 00:42:50.222
- Well they say I am insane.


00:42:51.956 --> 00:42:54.025
- Insane?


00:42:54.058 --> 00:42:56.528
It cannot be seen on your face.


00:42:58.361 --> 00:42:59.763
- Give me that!


00:42:59.796 --> 00:43:01.731
No reading, where
did you get this?


00:43:01.764 --> 00:43:02.965
- I found it.


00:43:02.998 --> 00:43:04.633
- This belongs to the nurses.


00:43:04.666 --> 00:43:07.036
If I catch you touching
the nurses' things again,


00:43:07.069 --> 00:43:10.272
I will send you
to the quiet room.


00:43:13.174 --> 00:43:14.708
- We're not allowed to read?


00:43:14.741 --> 00:43:18.045
- No, nothing that excites
the mind of fervent thinking.


00:43:18.078 --> 00:43:19.613
There are women who
have committed here


00:43:19.646 --> 00:43:21.147
for excessive reading.


00:43:21.180 --> 00:43:22.782
- For reading too much,
that's ridiculous.


00:43:22.815 --> 00:43:25.151
- You're too loud,
they will hear you.


00:43:25.184 --> 00:43:32.189
- Quiet ladies.


00:43:36.193 --> 00:43:37.694
- I
couldn't help but wonder


00:43:37.727 --> 00:43:40.296
about the minds of the nurses.


00:43:40.329 --> 00:43:41.631
What it must have been like


00:43:41.664 --> 00:43:43.165
to constantly fear
loosing control


00:43:43.198 --> 00:43:46.134
over hundreds of
mental patients.


00:43:46.167 --> 00:43:48.170
To fear loosing their position


00:43:48.203 --> 00:43:51.839
and to fear winding up in Blackwells as a patient themselves


00:43:51.872 --> 00:43:53.674
- Nellie Brown.


00:43:53.707 --> 00:43:55.609
- Leona Fox.


00:43:55.642 --> 00:43:57.711
- Why were you
brought to this place?


00:43:57.744 --> 00:44:00.013
- I caught my husband
with our chamber maid.


00:44:00.046 --> 00:44:01.780
Before I could accuse
him of adultery,


00:44:01.813 --> 00:44:05.117
he signed the papers to
have me committed for life.


00:44:09.320 --> 00:44:12.723
- Did you tell the doctors?


00:44:12.756 --> 00:44:15.258
- My accusations are
called delusional,


00:44:15.291 --> 00:44:17.660
proof to them of my
demented fantasies.


00:44:17.693 --> 00:44:20.763
But I saw them with
my own two eyes.


00:44:23.965 --> 00:44:28.036
A woman has no voice when
man signs her way as insane.


00:44:28.069 --> 00:44:31.105
It is only
after one is in trouble,


00:44:31.138 --> 00:44:33.040
that one realizes
how little sympathy


00:44:33.073 --> 00:44:35.875
and kindness there
is in the world.


00:44:54.090 --> 00:44:56.393
- Come out into the hall!


00:44:56.426 --> 00:44:58.227
- It's an invitation to supper.


00:44:58.260 --> 00:45:00.630
- Let's go everybody up,
out in the hall come on.


00:45:59.211 --> 00:46:01.946
- Nellie Brown, come with me.


00:46:01.979 --> 00:46:03.881
- Where am I being taken?


00:46:03.914 --> 00:46:06.350
- A judge is asking
questions about you.


00:46:06.383 --> 00:46:08.785
So you caught the
eye of Dr. Ingram.


00:46:08.818 --> 00:46:11.088
He wishes to speak with you.


00:46:22.864 --> 00:46:24.032
- Do you wish me to
stick out my tongue


00:46:24.065 --> 00:46:26.166
and hold out my hands?


00:46:26.199 --> 00:46:27.735
- No.


00:46:27.768 --> 00:46:30.169
No, that will not be
necessary this time.


00:46:30.202 --> 00:46:32.305
How are you sleeping?


00:46:32.338 --> 00:46:34.741
- How would you
sleep locked in here?


00:46:34.774 --> 00:46:36.441
- I'm here to help you.


00:46:36.474 --> 00:46:37.776
- Help me?


00:46:37.809 --> 00:46:39.277
- Yes, is there
anything bothering you


00:46:39.310 --> 00:46:41.879
that you would
like to talk about?


00:46:41.912 --> 00:46:45.449
- Yes, in case a fire should
break out in the asylum,


00:46:45.482 --> 00:46:47.884
all of the doors are
locked separately


00:46:47.917 --> 00:46:49.285
and the windows
are heavily bared


00:46:49.318 --> 00:46:51.254
so that escape is impossible.


00:46:51.287 --> 00:46:53.089
A fire is not improbable,


00:46:53.122 --> 00:46:54.923
but one of the most
likely occurrences.


00:46:54.956 --> 00:46:56.925
- Your nurses are expected
to open the doors.


00:46:56.958 --> 00:46:58.260
- Should the building burn,


00:46:58.293 --> 00:46:59.927
the jailers or nurses would
never think of releasing


00:46:59.960 --> 00:47:01.462
their crazy patients.


00:47:01.495 --> 00:47:05.932
These women will be
left to roast to death.


00:47:05.965 --> 00:47:07.200
Why don't you have a change?


00:47:07.233 --> 00:47:10.469
- I offer suggestions
until my brain is tired.


00:47:10.502 --> 00:47:12.071
But what would you do,


00:47:12.104 --> 00:47:14.340
a proclaimed insane girl?


00:47:14.373 --> 00:47:17.809
- Well I should insist on
them having locks put in,


00:47:17.842 --> 00:47:19.210
as I have seen in some places


00:47:19.243 --> 00:47:21.813
that by turning a crank
at the end of the hall,


00:47:21.846 --> 00:47:25.783
you can lock or unlock
every door on the one side.


00:47:25.816 --> 00:47:28.818
Then there is some
chance of escape.


00:47:28.851 --> 00:47:30.553
Now every door being
locked separately,


00:47:30.586 --> 00:47:33.055
there is absolutely none.


00:47:33.088 --> 00:47:34.856
- What institution
were you a inmate of


00:47:34.889 --> 00:47:36.925
before you came here?


00:47:39.027 --> 00:47:42.096
- None, I never was
confined to any institution.


00:47:42.129 --> 00:47:45.198
- Well then where did you see
the locks you have described.


00:47:45.231 --> 00:47:49.035
- I've seen them in
places I was in...


00:47:49.068 --> 00:47:51.537
I mean as a visitor.


00:47:51.570 --> 00:47:53.272
- There is only one
place I know of,


00:47:53.305 --> 00:47:55.007
where where they
have those locks.


00:47:55.040 --> 00:47:57.241
And that is at Sin Sing


00:47:57.274 --> 00:48:00.578
and the only ones going through
Sin Sing besides the inmates


00:48:00.611 --> 00:48:04.514
are the guards,
lawyers, and reporters.


00:48:05.715 --> 00:48:10.319
I assure you I had never update
been an inmate of Sin Sing


00:48:10.352 --> 00:48:12.455
or ever even visited.


00:48:22.562 --> 00:48:24.498
-
There were whispers


00:48:24.531 --> 00:48:26.299
that those who attempted
to get word out


00:48:26.332 --> 00:48:28.868
about the conditions
in the asylum,


00:48:28.901 --> 00:48:31.003
disappeared.


00:48:31.036 --> 00:48:33.104
I was increasingly
fearful that my notebook


00:48:33.137 --> 00:48:34.406
would be discovered.


00:48:54.355 --> 00:48:55.824
- Get away from that!


00:49:15.072 --> 00:49:16.474
- Have a look.


00:49:19.376 --> 00:49:22.079
- Exactly as you expected.


00:49:24.613 --> 00:49:29.117
- Urena, what is your age?


00:49:29.150 --> 00:49:32.420
- Why I am fourteen years old.


00:49:32.453 --> 00:49:35.222
- Fourteen years old?


00:49:35.255 --> 00:49:38.893
The doctors say
you are 26, not 14.


00:49:38.926 --> 00:49:41.661
- I am fourteen.


00:49:41.694 --> 00:49:43.196
- The doctors know better,


00:49:43.229 --> 00:49:46.198
they say that you're 26.


00:49:46.231 --> 00:49:48.467
- It is not true.


00:49:48.500 --> 00:49:50.135
I am fourteen years of age.


00:49:50.168 --> 00:49:51.203
You were fourteen


00:49:51.236 --> 00:49:52.937
when the accident happened.


00:49:52.970 --> 00:49:53.671
- What accident?


00:49:53.704 --> 00:49:55.640
What are you talking about?


00:49:57.441 --> 00:50:01.211
- Urena, do you
know where you are?


00:50:01.244 --> 00:50:05.047
- Yes, I am on rig


00:50:05.080 --> 00:50:07.950
at the garment factory.


00:50:07.983 --> 00:50:09.617
- At the garment factory?


00:50:09.650 --> 00:50:12.587
- That is where you
had your accident.


00:50:12.620 --> 00:50:14.389
Fell off the balcony and


00:50:14.422 --> 00:50:16.323
banged you head.


00:50:18.325 --> 00:50:21.594
- It isn't true.


00:50:21.627 --> 00:50:23.930
I'm at the factory
now, I'm on break.


00:50:23.963 --> 00:50:25.431
- It happened 12 years ago


00:50:25.464 --> 00:50:27.399
and that is when you came here.


00:50:27.432 --> 00:50:29.668
- 12 years ago?


00:50:29.701 --> 00:50:32.569
- Yes you fell and became
stuck at the age 14


00:50:32.602 --> 00:50:37.341
and you were sent here to
Blackwell's Women Asylum


00:50:37.374 --> 00:50:38.608
in my care.


00:50:41.577 --> 00:50:43.212
- No.


00:50:43.245 --> 00:50:47.449
It is not true, it is not true.


00:50:53.554 --> 00:50:55.989
Am I not at the factory?


00:50:56.022 --> 00:50:57.991
- No you're not at
the garment factory.


00:50:58.024 --> 00:50:59.526
You're in an insane asylum.


00:51:01.093 --> 00:51:01.727
- No.


00:51:01.760 --> 00:51:03.128
- No.


00:51:03.161 --> 00:51:04.063
- No!


00:51:04.096 --> 00:51:05.164
- No.


00:51:05.197 --> 00:51:06.165
- No!


00:51:06.198 --> 00:51:06.598
- No.


00:51:06.631 --> 00:51:07.332
- No!


00:51:07.365 --> 00:51:07.966
- No.


00:51:07.999 --> 00:51:08.533
- No!


00:51:08.566 --> 00:51:10.201
- No.


00:51:10.234 --> 00:51:12.103
- No it is not true.


00:51:12.136 --> 00:51:13.270
- Oh okay.


00:51:14.304 --> 00:51:15.639
Don't you push me around.


00:51:15.672 --> 00:51:18.541
I'm taking you to
the quiet room.


00:51:18.574 --> 00:51:19.575
Let's go.


00:51:25.546 --> 00:51:28.483
- Blackwell's
had a stench to it.


00:51:28.516 --> 00:51:30.084
Partly from the kitchens


00:51:30.117 --> 00:51:33.520
and partly from the
onsite crematorium.


00:51:33.553 --> 00:51:34.688
It had become clear to me


00:51:34.721 --> 00:51:37.724
that Blackwell's
was dumping ground.


00:51:37.757 --> 00:51:39.459
A place for the
city to rid itself


00:51:39.492 --> 00:51:42.494
of the overflow of the poor.


00:51:42.527 --> 00:51:45.564
Once committed, there
was no way to exit,


00:51:45.597 --> 00:51:48.266
except through the crematorium.


00:51:51.368 --> 00:51:53.169
What'd
you know about her?


00:51:53.202 --> 00:51:54.504
- Not much.


00:51:54.537 --> 00:51:57.774
She's arrogant and
a troublemaker.


00:51:57.807 --> 00:52:00.676
- Is she responding
to treatment?


00:52:00.709 --> 00:52:02.678
- We have her on Laudannum.


00:52:02.711 --> 00:52:05.313
Increase the dosage.


00:52:06.380 --> 00:52:08.249
- Hello Mrs. McGuinness.


00:52:08.282 --> 00:52:11.251
- Hello Miss Brown.


00:52:11.284 --> 00:52:12.719
- Why were you brought here?


00:52:12.752 --> 00:52:14.755
- I was sick.


00:52:14.788 --> 00:52:16.255
- Are you sick mentally?


00:52:16.288 --> 00:52:17.456
- No, no.


00:52:17.489 --> 00:52:21.093
I had been overworking
myself and I broke down.


00:52:21.126 --> 00:52:24.429
Having some family troubles
and being penniless


00:52:24.462 --> 00:52:25.697
and nowhere to go,


00:52:25.730 --> 00:52:27.132
I applied to the Commissioner's


00:52:27.165 --> 00:52:28.332
to be sent to the poor house


00:52:28.365 --> 00:52:31.268
until I would be
able to work again.


00:52:31.301 --> 00:52:33.037
- But they do not
send poor people here,


00:52:33.070 --> 00:52:35.471
unless they are insane?


00:52:35.504 --> 00:52:37.407
Don't you know there
are only insane women


00:52:37.440 --> 00:52:40.075
or those supposed
to be so sent here?


00:52:40.108 --> 00:52:42.744
- There are 1600 women
on Blackwell's Island,


00:52:42.777 --> 00:52:44.146
I knew when I got here


00:52:44.179 --> 00:52:46.180
that the majority of
these women were insane,


00:52:46.213 --> 00:52:48.482
but then I believed
them when they told me


00:52:48.515 --> 00:52:51.217
that this is the place
where they send all the poor


00:52:51.250 --> 00:52:53.153
who had applied for
aid, as I had done.


00:52:53.186 --> 00:52:55.121
- Really, I'm going to kill you.


00:52:55.154 --> 00:52:56.455
I'm going to kill you!


00:52:56.488 --> 00:52:58.257
- Who are they?


00:52:58.290 --> 00:53:00.459
- They're the women of the rope.


00:53:00.492 --> 00:53:02.093
They're considered to be
the most violent women


00:53:02.126 --> 00:53:03.728
on the island.


00:53:03.761 --> 00:53:05.363
The live in the lodge.


00:53:05.629 --> 00:53:08.398
I, myself, share
the fear that everyone felt,


00:53:08.431 --> 00:53:11.768
the possibility of being
sent to the violent ward.


00:53:11.801 --> 00:53:14.737
The mortality rate
there was high.


00:53:23.244 --> 00:53:24.746
One day a woman was brought in


00:53:24.779 --> 00:53:27.181
who had a fear of being touched


00:53:27.214 --> 00:53:31.518
and an extreme fear
of uncleanliness.


00:53:35.488 --> 00:53:36.755
- Sit down where
we get you set up,


00:53:36.788 --> 00:53:45.797
with a room and proper gown.


00:53:50.299 --> 00:53:52.202
- I'm Nellie Brown.


00:53:52.235 --> 00:53:53.470
- Margaret.


00:53:53.503 --> 00:53:58.541
- Tillie Mayard.


00:54:02.910 --> 00:54:03.878
- Put this on.


00:54:03.911 --> 00:54:05.445
- What here?


00:54:05.478 --> 00:54:07.781
- You left modesty
in the outside world.


00:54:07.814 --> 00:54:10.684
In Blackwell's we
have nothing to hide.


00:54:10.717 --> 00:54:13.285
- No I will not, it
is not dignified.


00:54:13.318 --> 00:54:16.222
That rag is soiled, I will
not put that dirty thing...


00:54:16.255 --> 00:54:17.822
No, no!


00:54:17.855 --> 00:54:19.324
Stop it no!


00:54:19.357 --> 00:54:21.326
Get your hands off me!


00:54:26.696 --> 00:54:31.534
No please.


00:54:35.803 --> 00:54:39.374
Please stop it, stop it.


00:54:39.407 --> 00:54:40.774
No.


00:54:57.454 --> 00:55:00.592
- I'll kill the devils
between my life.


00:55:04.561 --> 00:55:05.896
Poor
Matilda had finally


00:55:05.929 --> 00:55:08.398
avenged the attorneys
who stole her estate.


00:55:08.431 --> 00:55:09.665
- Take her to the retreat.


00:55:09.698 --> 00:55:10.799
- By
plunging the cook's knife


00:55:10.832 --> 00:55:12.868
into the heart of
one of the nurses.


00:55:12.901 --> 00:55:16.738
She was immediately sent to the
violent ward in the retreat.


00:55:20.840 --> 00:55:24.311
Is
it Nellie Brown.


00:55:26.745 --> 00:55:28.548
- Louise?


00:55:29.949 --> 00:55:31.684
Louise Schanz?


00:55:34.752 --> 00:55:36.188
Yes it's me.


00:55:36.221 --> 00:55:39.490
It's so cold.


00:55:42.693 --> 00:55:46.696
God, let me die.


00:56:27.296 --> 00:56:29.898
- Let me go.


00:56:39.773 --> 00:56:42.976
- Get your hands off me.


00:56:43.009 --> 00:56:46.012
Stop, stop!


00:56:46.045 --> 00:56:48.747
Let go of me.


00:57:05.027 --> 00:57:07.363
- They held
Margaret naked in the cold bath


00:57:07.396 --> 00:57:08.798
all through the night.


00:57:10.398 --> 00:57:12.734
- Help me carry her to her room.


00:57:38.721 --> 00:57:39.856
They inject into


00:57:39.889 --> 00:57:42.759
or force so much
opium on the patients,


00:57:42.792 --> 00:57:45.794
that the patients
are made crazy.


00:57:45.827 --> 00:57:47.729
A sure way to lose one's mind


00:57:47.762 --> 00:57:51.899
into the walls of
Blackwell's forever.


00:58:19.788 --> 00:58:22.792
- Everybody up bath
time, single file!


00:58:22.825 --> 00:58:25.427
- Do not take a
bath in that water.


00:58:25.460 --> 00:58:27.028
The very disease for
which I am suffering,


00:58:27.061 --> 00:58:28.963
and for which I need
doctoring makes it necessary


00:58:28.996 --> 00:58:31.098
that I should not
bathe in cold water.


00:58:31.131 --> 00:58:32.800
I do not want to
go into that water.


00:58:32.833 --> 00:58:35.102
It is filthy and filled
with human excrement


00:58:35.135 --> 00:58:38.605
and the burst eruptions
of sick patients' skin.


00:58:51.849 --> 00:58:53.717
- She's dead.


00:58:53.750 --> 00:58:55.618
How was she last night?


00:58:55.651 --> 00:58:57.887
These bruises on her cheeks,


00:58:57.920 --> 00:59:01.423
it looks as if she
was in a fight.


00:59:01.456 --> 00:59:04.727
- She was agitated doctor.


00:59:04.760 --> 00:59:06.828
- I see.


00:59:06.861 --> 00:59:10.532
Obviously she died
of convulsion.


00:59:13.733 --> 00:59:16.636
I'll make out the
death certificate.


00:59:18.771 --> 00:59:20.139
I'm finished here.


00:59:20.172 --> 00:59:21.607
-
Margaret was cremated


00:59:21.640 --> 00:59:25.009
and put into lead tin
with only a number,


00:59:25.042 --> 00:59:27.612
like many hundreds before her.


00:59:59.070 --> 01:00:03.174
- Don't stop Miss
Brown, play another.


01:00:03.207 --> 01:00:05.576
- I never learned to dance.


01:00:05.609 --> 01:00:07.745
- It isn't that difficult.


01:00:07.778 --> 01:00:08.812
- I said no.


01:00:40.572 --> 01:00:42.808
- I can play no more.


01:00:42.841 --> 01:00:44.575
My hands have stoke up.


01:00:44.608 --> 01:00:45.743
- No matter,


01:00:45.776 --> 01:00:48.045
when one has music
in one's spirit.


01:01:03.123 --> 01:01:04.859
- No.


01:01:46.226 --> 01:01:48.829
- I want to go home.


01:02:24.124 --> 01:02:26.159
- How are you doing?


01:02:26.192 --> 01:02:27.760
I'm super intendant.


01:02:27.793 --> 01:02:31.063
Anne how are you today?


01:02:32.730 --> 01:02:34.199
- Stay back.


01:02:37.001 --> 01:02:38.036
She has a fever.


01:02:38.069 --> 01:02:39.303
What is this patient's name?


01:02:39.336 --> 01:02:41.605
- Her name is Louise Schanz.


01:02:41.638 --> 01:02:42.773
She doesn't belong here


01:02:42.806 --> 01:02:45.208
they took her baby away
at Belview Hospital.


01:02:48.344 --> 01:02:50.212
- Louise?


01:02:50.245 --> 01:02:51.713
- She is suffering from the cold


01:02:51.746 --> 01:02:53.048
and insufficient clothing.


01:02:53.081 --> 01:02:55.050
- The nurses will beat you.


01:02:55.083 --> 01:02:56.084
- Take her away.


01:03:13.164 --> 01:03:17.302
So what do you know
of Louise Schanz


01:03:17.335 --> 01:03:19.903
and why do you care?


01:03:19.936 --> 01:03:21.605
- I know that she is sane


01:03:21.638 --> 01:03:23.840
and does not belong
in this place.


01:03:23.873 --> 01:03:25.174
I know that her English is poor


01:03:25.207 --> 01:03:27.777
and she has no way to speak
her case to any justice.


01:03:27.810 --> 01:03:29.745
- I see


01:03:29.778 --> 01:03:33.915
and how did you get here?


01:03:33.948 --> 01:03:37.351
- I was committed as an
insane woman in this asylum.


01:03:37.384 --> 01:03:38.986
I am here without
hope of release.


01:03:39.019 --> 01:03:40.721
- And you think you are insane?


01:03:40.754 --> 01:03:41.955
- No I am not insane.


01:03:41.988 --> 01:03:45.625
- Of course,
everybody says that.


01:03:45.658 --> 01:03:47.093
- So you think,


01:03:47.126 --> 01:03:49.995
Mrs. Schanz is being persecuted?


01:03:51.630 --> 01:03:52.931
- No not persecuted but...


01:03:52.964 --> 01:03:55.700
- You said she's
wrongfully committed here.


01:03:55.733 --> 01:03:56.667
- Yes but...


01:03:56.700 --> 01:03:58.369
- So you are not insane,


01:03:58.402 --> 01:04:00.737
Mrs. Schanz is not insane.


01:04:00.770 --> 01:04:04.274
Is everyone wrongfully
committed here as well?


01:04:07.275 --> 01:04:09.044
- I can see that these
patients need help.


01:04:09.077 --> 01:04:11.179
- And you Florence Nightingale


01:04:11.212 --> 01:04:13.181
are going to help them all.


01:04:13.214 --> 01:04:14.749
Is that it?


01:04:16.883 --> 01:04:20.988
Delusions such as these can
be cured with medication.


01:04:21.021 --> 01:04:23.623
- They force me to drink
the medication every night,


01:04:23.656 --> 01:04:24.857
it's not right.


01:04:24.890 --> 01:04:27.259
- No we're giving you
the wrong medication.


01:04:27.292 --> 01:04:30.261
I don't recall seeing
a medical degree


01:04:30.294 --> 01:04:32.330
on your admission papers.


01:04:32.363 --> 01:04:34.165
Did I miss something?


01:04:38.168 --> 01:04:41.070
You really must
trust me Miss Brown.


01:04:41.103 --> 01:04:44.307
We are the doctors
here, not you.


01:04:44.340 --> 01:04:48.810
I am a doctor and I want
the best for my patients.


01:04:48.843 --> 01:04:50.312
I truly do.


01:04:53.947 --> 01:04:58.218
Tell Dr. Kinier to increase
Miss Brown's nightly dose


01:04:58.251 --> 01:05:02.688
of Laudannum to 150
parts per thousand.


01:05:02.721 --> 01:05:04.390
- Yes Doctor.


01:05:04.423 --> 01:05:06.925
- That should put
your mind at rest.


01:05:06.958 --> 01:05:10.695
You see, I'm just
trying the best I can.


01:05:13.297 --> 01:05:15.199
Have a good day.


01:05:19.402 --> 01:05:21.304
- Go on, mind your business.


01:05:33.814 --> 01:05:35.315
- I want my book and pencil.


01:05:35.348 --> 01:05:37.316
It helps me remember things.


01:05:37.349 --> 01:05:39.719
- You can't have it, so shut up.


01:05:39.752 --> 01:05:43.389
- Give it back or I shall
have to tell Dr. Ingram.


01:05:45.790 --> 01:05:47.059
- You had no book or pencil.


01:05:47.092 --> 01:05:49.060
- I just watched you
place it in your apron.


01:05:49.093 --> 01:05:51.729
- I advise you to fight
against the imaginations


01:05:51.762 --> 01:05:52.964
of your brain.


01:06:04.106 --> 01:06:07.375
- Benny, is that
my husband Benny?


01:06:07.408 --> 01:06:08.843
- I'm sure your mistaken.


01:06:08.876 --> 01:06:10.178
- It's Benny.


01:06:10.211 --> 01:06:11.778
Benny my husband, he's come
to take me out of here.


01:06:11.811 --> 01:06:13.880
- Stop it, that is
not your husband.


01:06:13.913 --> 01:06:15.348
- It's Benny, he's
come to free me.


01:06:15.381 --> 01:06:17.116
- Benny I'm here.
- No dear.


01:06:17.149 --> 01:06:19.385
- Benny, Benny.
- Give up alright.


01:06:19.418 --> 01:06:21.254
He's come to free me Benny.


01:06:23.187 --> 01:06:24.355
- Just leave her alone.


01:06:24.388 --> 01:06:25.957
- Benny take me out of here.


01:06:25.990 --> 01:06:27.358
- Leave her alone.


01:06:27.391 --> 01:06:28.259
- Let's go.


01:06:28.292 --> 01:06:30.161
- Stop!


01:06:37.399 --> 01:06:41.236
- Inmates running the asylum...


01:06:41.269 --> 01:06:43.872
I don't think so.


01:06:48.041 --> 01:06:51.845
You have brought this
particular lesson on yourself.


01:07:05.956 --> 01:07:07.291
Miss Grupe?


01:07:07.324 --> 01:07:09.426
Yes Doctor?


01:07:09.459 --> 01:07:13.330
- What happened to this patient?


01:07:13.363 --> 01:07:15.998
- She was trying
to escape doctor.


01:07:16.031 --> 01:07:18.234
She had the delusions
that her husband is coming


01:07:18.267 --> 01:07:21.202
to take her out of Blackwell's.


01:07:21.235 --> 01:07:24.539
- How did she get
those black eyes?


01:07:24.572 --> 01:07:28.408
- She had the bruises
when she was brought in.


01:07:28.441 --> 01:07:32.512
- Now, they look fresh to me.


01:07:32.545 --> 01:07:37.383
Are you sure she had
it when she came in?


01:07:37.416 --> 01:07:41.153
- I will have a good
talking with the orderlies.


01:07:41.186 --> 01:07:42.755
Get to the bottom of this.


01:07:44.588 --> 01:07:47.458
- Make sure you do that.


01:07:47.491 --> 01:07:51.828
This is not a prison Miss Grupe.


01:07:51.861 --> 01:07:53.797
It's a medical facility,


01:07:53.830 --> 01:07:56.131
where we're trying
to help people,


01:07:56.164 --> 01:07:58.300
to give them a better life.


01:07:58.333 --> 01:07:59.902
Is that clear Miss Grupe?


01:07:59.935 --> 01:08:01.435
- Yes Doctor.


01:08:01.468 --> 01:08:03.004
As it turned out,


01:08:03.037 --> 01:08:05.573
Mrs. Cotter wasn't delusional.


01:08:05.606 --> 01:08:07.541
Her husband Benny had
actually been doing everything


01:08:07.574 --> 01:08:10.277
in his power to take
her out of Blackwell's,


01:08:10.310 --> 01:08:13.212
but was caught in bureaucracy.


01:08:14.279 --> 01:08:16.983
Eventually he trialed
and won her release.


01:09:03.187 --> 01:09:05.522
- What is it now Miss Grupe?


01:09:05.555 --> 01:09:09.025
- One of the nurses took
this from the patient,


01:09:09.058 --> 01:09:10.492
Nellie Brown.


01:09:10.525 --> 01:09:13.429
- Let me have it.


01:09:17.899 --> 01:09:19.234
Has anyone seen this?


01:09:19.267 --> 01:09:21.236
- No Doctor.


01:09:21.269 --> 01:09:25.372
- It's very organized and
articulate for a mental patient.


01:09:26.206 --> 01:09:27.573
- There is something
else Doctor.


01:09:27.606 --> 01:09:29.141
- Well?


01:09:29.174 --> 01:09:32.445
- A reporter is here asking
to speak with Nellie Brown.


01:09:32.478 --> 01:09:35.480
- A reporter?


01:09:39.283 --> 01:09:44.055
It is the fault of that meddling
judge who sent her here.


01:09:48.057 --> 01:09:50.392
We can't deny them
access to her.


01:09:50.425 --> 01:09:53.528
That would only create
a sensational story.


01:09:53.561 --> 01:09:55.664
Let him meet with her.


01:09:55.697 --> 01:09:58.466
But make sure they're
never out of close sight


01:09:58.499 --> 01:10:00.001
of the nursing staff.


01:10:00.034 --> 01:10:01.168
- Yes Doctor.


01:10:01.201 --> 01:10:04.004
- And if she says
anything, anything


01:10:04.037 --> 01:10:07.307
that could be harmful
to this institution,


01:10:07.340 --> 01:10:08.908
see that she's cut off.


01:10:12.144 --> 01:10:14.246
- Here put that on quickly.


01:10:26.255 --> 01:10:27.523
- If you make it a
practice of telling,


01:10:27.556 --> 01:10:29.191
it will be a serious
thing for you.


01:10:29.224 --> 01:10:30.559
To my surprise,


01:10:30.591 --> 01:10:32.060
I was brought face-to-face
with the first reporter


01:10:32.093 --> 01:10:33.428
I had ever worked alongside


01:10:33.461 --> 01:10:34.996
at the Pittsburgh Dispatch.


01:10:35.029 --> 01:10:36.430
- I do not know this man.


01:10:36.463 --> 01:10:38.032
- Do you know her?


01:10:38.065 --> 01:10:39.700
- No this is not the young
lady, I came in search of.


01:10:39.733 --> 01:10:42.435
I was mistaken, I thought
she was somebody else,


01:10:42.468 --> 01:10:45.271
somebody I knew a long time ago.


01:10:45.304 --> 01:10:48.240
- If you do not know her,
you cannot stay here.


01:10:49.174 --> 01:10:51.009
- One moment Señor...


01:10:51.042 --> 01:10:52.978
Do you speak Spanish, Señor?


01:10:53.011 --> 01:10:54.211
- No...


01:10:54.244 --> 01:10:55.579
What in places are
you doing in here?


01:10:55.612 --> 01:10:59.649
- It's alright, I'm after
an item, keep still.


01:10:59.682 --> 01:11:03.119
- No I'm afraid I do not
speak a word of Spanish.


01:11:03.152 --> 01:11:04.521
It was
Wilson, who's article


01:11:04.554 --> 01:11:06.188
I had anonymously responded to,


01:11:06.221 --> 01:11:09.158
that launched my
career as a reporter.


01:11:30.274 --> 01:11:31.242
- Come with me.


01:11:31.275 --> 01:11:33.511
- Please.


01:11:33.544 --> 01:11:36.747
Please I'm so cold,
I can't stay here.


01:11:36.780 --> 01:11:38.549
- Where are you taking her?


01:11:38.582 --> 01:11:44.454
- She needs help.


01:11:48.356 --> 01:11:50.258
- Anne Neville was one
of the quietest women


01:11:50.291 --> 01:11:51.759
in the institution.


01:11:51.792 --> 01:11:54.128
To protect herself
and her sanity,


01:11:54.161 --> 01:11:57.530
she did everything she was
told without complaint.


01:11:57.563 --> 01:11:59.232
I admired her strength


01:11:59.265 --> 01:12:02.168
and determination of will.


01:12:02.201 --> 01:12:06.171
♪ Mid pleasures


01:12:06.204 --> 01:12:09.707
♪ And palaces


01:12:09.740 --> 01:12:14.478
♪ Though we may roam


01:12:15.545 --> 01:12:19.182
♪ Be it ever


01:12:19.215 --> 01:12:22.385
♪ So humble


01:12:22.418 --> 01:12:24.487
♪ There's no


01:12:24.520 --> 01:12:29.290
♪ Place like home


01:12:29.323 --> 01:12:32.760
♪ A charm from


01:12:32.793 --> 01:12:35.496
♪ The sky


01:12:35.529 --> 01:12:40.533
♪ Seems to hallow us here


01:12:43.201 --> 01:12:48.073
♪ Which seek through the world


01:12:48.473 --> 01:12:53.478
♪ Is ne'er met with elsewhere


01:12:56.846 --> 01:13:02.051
♪ Home, home


01:13:02.217 --> 01:13:05.587
♪ Sweet, sweet


01:13:05.620 --> 01:13:07.789
♪ Home


01:13:07.822 --> 01:13:11.492
♪ There's no place


01:13:11.525 --> 01:13:13.493
♪ Like home ♪


01:13:13.526 --> 01:13:15.429
- Get away from here.


01:13:29.773 --> 01:13:32.510
- Everybody up, bath
time single file!


01:13:41.316 --> 01:13:43.852
- I don't think I'm
going to survive today.


01:13:43.885 --> 01:13:47.055
- Don't fight them, they'll
move you through faster.


01:13:56.462 --> 01:13:58.297
As much
as I hated the baths,


01:13:58.330 --> 01:13:59.465
I would have taken another


01:13:59.498 --> 01:14:04.269
if it could've saved
Tillie from hers.


01:14:08.172 --> 01:14:10.173
My heart ached to
see Tille Mayard go


01:14:10.206 --> 01:14:11.575
from recovered from her sickness


01:14:11.608 --> 01:14:13.643
when she had been
brought to Blackwell's,


01:14:13.676 --> 01:14:17.513
to growing ever sicker
as they days wore on.


01:14:17.546 --> 01:14:20.583
Tillie had changed so
much for the worse,


01:14:20.616 --> 01:14:23.418
that I was mortified
when I looked at her.


01:14:33.325 --> 01:14:35.695
- You must keep your spirits up.


01:14:48.338 --> 01:14:51.307
- It is cruel to lock people
up and then freeze them.


01:14:51.340 --> 01:14:53.710
- She has as much
has any of the rest,


01:14:53.743 --> 01:14:54.878
she'll get no more.


01:15:04.685 --> 01:15:05.920
- Let her fall on the floor


01:15:05.953 --> 01:15:07.420
and this will
teach her a lesson.


01:15:08.855 --> 01:15:10.323
- You are cruel to
treat her this way,


01:15:10.356 --> 01:15:12.459
can't you see she is
suffering and in need of care.


01:15:12.492 --> 01:15:14.760
- She needs medical help.


01:15:24.568 --> 01:15:27.571
- You must send help for a
patient, Miss Tille Mayard.


01:15:27.604 --> 01:15:28.906
She is having a
fit from the cold


01:15:28.939 --> 01:15:30.840
and the nurses are not
sending for a doctor.


01:15:30.873 --> 01:15:32.441
They're doing
nothing to help her.


01:15:32.474 --> 01:15:34.443
- Please calm
yourself Miss Brown.


01:15:34.476 --> 01:15:36.745
- See that Dr. Kinier is
dispatched to Miss Tillie Mayard


01:15:36.778 --> 01:15:38.947
at once.


01:15:38.980 --> 01:15:41.383
There see, she will be helped.


01:15:41.416 --> 01:15:43.284
Now please, calm yourself.


01:15:43.317 --> 01:15:44.351
- I will not.


01:15:44.384 --> 01:15:45.586
The cold is so bad,


01:15:45.619 --> 01:15:47.587
it sent Miss Mayard into a fit.


01:15:47.620 --> 01:15:50.356
I fear she will not survive.


01:15:50.389 --> 01:15:56.729
- I will see to
these things at once.


01:16:01.398 --> 01:16:02.500
- Why?


01:16:02.533 --> 01:16:05.202
Why am I being given
special treatment?


01:16:05.235 --> 01:16:08.271
Why is the Assistant
Superintendent so interested


01:16:08.304 --> 01:16:09.839
in my case, in particular?


01:16:09.872 --> 01:16:12.441
- We care about the
treatment of all patients


01:16:12.474 --> 01:16:14.911
at Blackwell's Insane Asylum.


01:16:18.246 --> 01:16:21.316
And a Judge Duffy has
been sending reporters


01:16:21.349 --> 01:16:23.517
to ask about you.


01:16:25.285 --> 01:16:28.221
Tell me, do you
think you are insane?


01:16:30.356 --> 01:16:31.657
- Yes insane.


01:16:31.690 --> 01:16:34.626
I have watched insanity
slowly creeping over minds


01:16:34.659 --> 01:16:36.528
that had appeared to be alright.


01:16:36.561 --> 01:16:40.331
I curse all doctors, nurses,
and public institutions


01:16:40.364 --> 01:16:41.532
for their treatment of people


01:16:41.565 --> 01:16:43.768
that have no advocacy.


01:16:47.503 --> 01:16:51.340
- I will order Miss Grady
to see that more clothing


01:16:51.373 --> 01:16:54.543
is given to the patients.


01:17:14.992 --> 01:17:17.328
- Hand it over,
you know the rules.


01:17:17.361 --> 01:17:18.596
No reading.


01:17:18.629 --> 01:17:19.830
- It is only a book of psalms.


01:17:19.863 --> 01:17:21.765
- Reading agitates the mind.


01:17:21.798 --> 01:17:23.667
- How can book of psalms
be bad for the mind?


01:17:23.700 --> 01:17:25.735
- Hand me the book.


01:17:30.306 --> 01:17:36.678
Hand it over.


01:17:40.847 --> 01:17:42.816
You did this to yourself.


01:17:45.785 --> 01:17:47.387
Take her to the quiet room.


01:17:47.420 --> 01:17:52.858
- You're not human.


01:18:06.601 --> 01:18:07.803
- Brown go to the kitchen,


01:18:07.836 --> 01:18:10.006
get a meal and take it
to Mrs. Schanz's room.


01:18:11.639 --> 01:18:12.640
At the
kitchen I was greeted


01:18:12.673 --> 01:18:14.709
with a spread of fresh fruits,


01:18:14.742 --> 01:18:17.444
marveled meats,
and fine cheeses.


01:18:17.477 --> 01:18:19.446
Food, the likes of
which was never shared


01:18:19.479 --> 01:18:21.748
with the patients.


01:18:21.781 --> 01:18:23.582
- Mrs. Schanz is
ill, what about that?


01:18:23.615 --> 01:18:27.320
- That's for the doctor.


01:18:40.830 --> 01:18:43.733
- 150 degrees, I think.


01:18:46.901 --> 01:18:49.638
- How high as your
temperature ever run?


01:18:49.671 --> 01:18:52.740
- Perhaps 101 degrees.


01:18:52.773 --> 01:18:55.877
- It's 99 degrees.


01:19:00.046 --> 01:19:02.515
- I brought you some food.


01:19:02.548 --> 01:19:03.549
- I do not want it.


01:19:03.582 --> 01:19:05.751
- I know how you feel,


01:19:05.784 --> 01:19:08.821
but you need your strength.


01:19:08.854 --> 01:19:10.088
Did they hit you?


01:19:10.121 --> 01:19:13.658
- I have gotten beatings
from Miss Grupe.


01:19:14.991 --> 01:19:18.628
I am so cold.


01:19:18.661 --> 01:19:23.366
I will never see my son again.


01:19:24.733 --> 01:19:27.402
If only I could die.


01:19:33.006 --> 01:19:36.544
Nein, nein, nein.


01:19:38.010 --> 01:19:39.546
Please.


01:19:40.913 --> 01:19:42.782
No, please there's
nothing wrong with me.


01:19:42.815 --> 01:19:44.783
- Now, now, dear Mrs. Schanz.


01:19:44.816 --> 01:19:47.786
We're here to help you.


01:19:47.819 --> 01:19:48.920
Hold her down.


01:19:48.953 --> 01:19:51.655
- No, please.


01:19:51.688 --> 01:19:52.490
- She doesn't need an injection,


01:19:52.523 --> 01:19:53.791
she just needs rest.


01:19:53.824 --> 01:19:54.892
Do not inject her,


01:19:54.925 --> 01:19:57.127
she only had a
mild coughing fit.


01:19:57.160 --> 01:19:58.461
Do not inject her.


01:19:58.494 --> 01:20:00.964
- Miss Brown enough!


01:20:04.065 --> 01:20:06.435
- There, there.


01:20:10.738 --> 01:20:13.073
Isn't that better?


01:20:16.109 --> 01:20:21.114
- Franklin, you've
grown so much.


01:20:22.881 --> 01:20:25.117
Come dance with me.


01:20:52.972 --> 01:20:55.708
- You have killed her.


01:20:55.741 --> 01:20:56.976
You have killed her.


01:20:57.009 --> 01:20:58.677
- Take Miss Brown
back to her room.


01:20:58.710 --> 01:21:01.213
Send Mrs. Schanz
to the crematorium.


01:21:01.246 --> 01:21:03.215
I will make out the papers.


01:21:03.248 --> 01:21:05.483
- You are a cruel
and inhumane man.


01:21:05.516 --> 01:21:08.986
- Why are you fighting
this so much, Miss Brown?


01:21:09.019 --> 01:21:12.656
I'm trying to bring
these people some relief.


01:21:12.689 --> 01:21:14.624
- By killing them?


01:21:14.657 --> 01:21:16.993
- It was not the intention.


01:21:35.941 --> 01:21:38.678
- You have brought
this up on yourself.


01:21:57.025 --> 01:21:58.828
- Get off the grass!


01:22:03.264 --> 01:22:06.968
- Tillie.


01:22:07.001 --> 01:22:08.802
Tillie?


01:22:08.835 --> 01:22:11.972
- I dreamed of my
mother last night.


01:22:12.005 --> 01:22:18.144
I think she may come
today and take me home.


01:22:22.747 --> 01:22:24.682
I'm cold.


01:22:24.715 --> 01:22:27.518
No don't touch me!


01:22:27.551 --> 01:22:29.720
- I'm trying to warm you.


01:22:32.555 --> 01:22:37.025
- You, you are a traitor.


01:22:37.058 --> 01:22:39.227
There doing this to
me because of you.


01:22:39.260 --> 01:22:40.829
- What?


01:22:40.862 --> 01:22:43.864
- You're trying to pass
yourself off as me.


01:22:43.897 --> 01:22:45.032
- Tillie what do you mean?


01:22:45.065 --> 01:22:47.768
- The reporters and the doctors


01:22:47.801 --> 01:22:50.303
that have come calling
to see Nellie Brown


01:22:50.336 --> 01:22:53.039
are friends in search of me.


01:22:53.072 --> 01:22:55.741
But you are, by some means,


01:22:55.774 --> 01:22:59.644
trying to deceive
them that you are me.


01:22:59.677 --> 01:23:01.145
- No Tillie, I am your friend.


01:23:01.178 --> 01:23:04.015
- You are not my friend!


01:23:05.949 --> 01:23:09.620
- I am here because of you.


01:23:14.022 --> 01:23:15.124
- Tillie,


01:23:15.157 --> 01:23:16.991
what have they
been doing to you?


01:23:17.024 --> 01:23:18.159
They've been injecting
you with opium.


01:23:18.192 --> 01:23:21.129
- It's your fault.


01:23:21.162 --> 01:23:23.664
You trick me into singing,


01:23:23.697 --> 01:23:26.934
so you can steal my voice.


01:23:26.967 --> 01:23:28.668
- No.


01:23:30.636 --> 01:23:35.140
- I can't stay in this
place another day.


01:23:39.177 --> 01:23:40.911
- Tillie shut up


01:23:40.944 --> 01:23:42.580
or I will help you to shut up.


01:23:42.613 --> 01:23:44.014
- Tillie.


01:23:44.047 --> 01:23:45.550
- Get away from me.


01:23:55.323 --> 01:23:57.658
- There are 16
doctors on this island


01:23:57.691 --> 01:23:59.060
and excepting two,


01:23:59.093 --> 01:24:01.596
I have never seen them pay
any attention to the patients.


01:24:01.629 --> 01:24:04.798
How can a doctor judge
a woman's sanity,


01:24:04.831 --> 01:24:06.833
merely by bidding
her good morning


01:24:06.866 --> 01:24:09.902
and refusing to hear
her pleas for release?


01:24:11.336 --> 01:24:14.772
You have no right to
keep sane people here.


01:24:14.805 --> 01:24:16.774
I am sane, have always been so


01:24:16.807 --> 01:24:19.010
and I must insist on
a thorough examination


01:24:19.043 --> 01:24:20.911
or be released.


01:24:20.944 --> 01:24:23.180
Several of the women
here are also sane.


01:24:23.213 --> 01:24:24.781
Why can't they be free?


01:24:24.814 --> 01:24:27.917
- They are insane


01:24:27.950 --> 01:24:31.321
and suffering from delusions.


01:24:32.120 --> 01:24:33.688
- You are such a damn whore,


01:24:33.721 --> 01:24:35.924
it's a good thing for you
that you are being transferred


01:24:35.957 --> 01:24:38.158
or I will make you pay
so well for remembering


01:24:38.191 --> 01:24:41.061
to tell Dr. Ingram everything.


01:24:41.094 --> 01:24:42.997
You forget everything
about yourself,


01:24:43.030 --> 01:24:46.166
but you never forget
anything to tell the Doctor.


01:25:00.710 --> 01:25:02.312
- Not sure I'll be able
to sleep with Matilda


01:25:02.345 --> 01:25:03.980
up creeping about.


01:25:04.013 --> 01:25:07.216
- She's probably out searching
for somebody she want to kill


01:25:07.249 --> 01:25:10.252
- Someone down there.


01:25:11.887 --> 01:25:13.955
- I heard the nurses
talking about you.


01:25:13.988 --> 01:25:15.223
- What did they say?


01:25:15.256 --> 01:25:17.291
- You were to be shut
off from all visitors,


01:25:17.324 --> 01:25:21.695
because you talk too
much out of turn.


01:25:21.728 --> 01:25:23.130
- That's why we were
sent to the violent ward


01:25:23.163 --> 01:25:24.730
to get rid of us.


01:25:24.763 --> 01:25:26.699
I puzzled over
why they sent Anne Neville


01:25:26.732 --> 01:25:28.367
to the violent ward with me.


01:25:28.400 --> 01:25:30.802
I determined that it was
the strength of her spirit,


01:25:30.835 --> 01:25:33.038
her unwillingness to let
the nurses break her will


01:25:33.071 --> 01:25:35.205
that had them focused on her.


01:25:35.238 --> 01:25:37.441
So they sent Anne,
the strongest,


01:25:37.474 --> 01:25:41.411
and me, the loudest, to the
violent ward to finish us.


01:25:58.758 --> 01:25:59.993
- Why was I put in here?


01:26:00.026 --> 01:26:00.761
- Shut up.


01:26:11.802 --> 01:26:14.939
- I understand you been
having continuing trouble


01:26:14.972 --> 01:26:19.076
with fever thinking
and hallucinations.


01:26:19.109 --> 01:26:21.911
- I've had nothing of the sort.


01:26:21.944 --> 01:26:24.013
I'm as sane as anyone.


01:26:24.046 --> 01:26:27.716
- You've demonstrated
delusions of persecution,


01:26:27.749 --> 01:26:31.953
thinking that the orderlies
and nurses are against you,


01:26:31.986 --> 01:26:35.289
that they wish to cause you
harm, instead of help you.


01:26:35.322 --> 01:26:39.225
And that we, your
doctors are murderers.


01:26:39.258 --> 01:26:41.160
- The things I have seen,


01:26:41.193 --> 01:26:43.763
the things I have
told to Dr. Ingram,


01:26:43.796 --> 01:26:44.930
all of them are true.


01:26:44.963 --> 01:26:47.499
- There are many truths
here at Blackwell's.


01:26:47.532 --> 01:26:51.969
It is after all, an
asylum for the insane.


01:26:55.105 --> 01:26:58.041
- I do not need an injection,


01:26:58.074 --> 01:26:59.843
I am perfectly sane.


01:26:59.876 --> 01:27:03.312
- Nearly all the patients
here deny their insanity.


01:27:03.345 --> 01:27:05.814
- Besides you nightly medicate
me with an opium drink.


01:27:05.847 --> 01:27:08.449
- It is clear that in your case,


01:27:08.482 --> 01:27:10.919
you need something stronger.


01:27:11.819 --> 01:27:13.854
- No, no, no, no.


01:27:13.887 --> 01:27:14.454
No, no!


01:27:14.487 --> 01:27:15.355
- Hold her still.


01:27:15.388 --> 01:27:17.257
- No, no, no!


01:27:17.290 --> 01:27:19.792
No, no!


01:27:36.972 --> 01:27:38.508
- Let her be for a bit.


01:27:41.210 --> 01:27:42.444
Check back on her in an hour.


01:27:57.356 --> 01:28:00.259
- You better alert
the crematorium.


01:28:04.362 --> 01:28:07.098
- Excuse me, what are you doing?


01:28:07.131 --> 01:28:08.232
- Superintendent Dent?


01:28:08.265 --> 01:28:09.367
- Yes?


01:28:09.400 --> 01:28:11.835
- I am Peter A.
Hendricks esquire.


01:28:11.868 --> 01:28:13.537
I am an attorney
representing a family,


01:28:13.570 --> 01:28:15.372
willing to take
care of the patient,


01:28:15.405 --> 01:28:16.572
known as Nellie Brown.


01:28:16.605 --> 01:28:18.107
- Nellie Brown of course,


01:28:18.140 --> 01:28:20.576
the amnesia case.


01:28:20.609 --> 01:28:25.380
Nellie Brown is unfortunately
a very sick girl


01:28:25.413 --> 01:28:29.183
and I cannot vouch for
the safety of her health.


01:28:29.216 --> 01:28:31.285
If she were to be
released at this time.


01:28:38.991 --> 01:28:42.027
- A Judge Duffy has
signed the order,


01:28:42.060 --> 01:28:45.830
transferring her
into my custody.


01:28:45.863 --> 01:28:49.133
As you can see, it is official.


01:28:53.336 --> 01:28:55.238
- Have a seat.


01:28:55.271 --> 01:28:58.941
We have hundreds of patients
here at Blackwell's,


01:28:58.974 --> 01:29:03.044
it will take a little
time to locate her.


01:29:03.077 --> 01:29:05.046
- I'm not going anywhere.


01:29:05.079 --> 01:29:07.281
- What is the condition
of Nellie Brown?


01:29:07.314 --> 01:29:11.017
- I left Miss McCarten to
take her to the crematorium.


01:29:11.050 --> 01:29:13.119
- Open it, open it!


01:29:16.188 --> 01:29:17.590
Step aside!


01:29:30.433 --> 01:29:34.136
Come Miss Brown,
come back to us.


01:29:34.169 --> 01:29:35.571
Wake up!


01:29:35.604 --> 01:29:36.906
Come out of it!


01:29:36.939 --> 01:29:40.275
Miss Brown, I need
you to wake up!


01:29:53.519 --> 01:29:55.954
- We're ruined.


01:29:55.987 --> 01:29:59.124
Blackwell's will be ended.


01:30:01.358 --> 01:30:03.227
I won't have it.


01:30:15.671 --> 01:30:18.006
- Her heart is beating.


01:30:18.039 --> 01:30:19.240
- What?


01:30:19.273 --> 01:30:20.642
- Her heart is beating!


01:30:23.044 --> 01:30:25.612
- So it works.


01:30:25.645 --> 01:30:28.115
I was right.


01:30:28.148 --> 01:30:31.984
It works.


01:30:32.017 --> 01:30:34.120
Watch over her tonight.


01:30:34.153 --> 01:30:36.588
Make sure she gets
plenty of water.


01:30:36.621 --> 01:30:40.125
At sunrise send
her into the yard.


01:30:40.158 --> 01:30:42.993
Have your nurses keep
close watch over her


01:30:43.026 --> 01:30:44.395
until I call for her.


01:30:44.428 --> 01:30:45.897
- Yes Doctor.


01:31:02.409 --> 01:31:04.945
- Bridget.


01:31:04.978 --> 01:31:06.580
What have they done to you?


01:31:09.182 --> 01:31:12.485
- Insane, it cannot
be seen on your face.


01:31:20.591 --> 01:31:23.360
- Brown, you're to come with me.


01:31:23.393 --> 01:31:24.695
Where am I going?


01:31:24.728 --> 01:31:28.197
- A lawyer, Mr. Hendricks
is here to see you.


01:31:36.137 --> 01:31:40.207
- You are the strongest
woman I have ever met.


01:31:40.240 --> 01:31:42.509
- And you are leaving.


01:31:42.542 --> 01:31:44.510
- I'll be back.


01:31:44.543 --> 01:31:47.180
- No you won't.


01:31:47.213 --> 01:31:51.150
- You'd have to be
crazy to come back here.


01:31:53.318 --> 01:31:57.588
I never want to
see you here again.


01:32:02.158 --> 01:32:04.161
- No hugging.


01:32:16.504 --> 01:32:19.673
- This is Peter A.
Hendricks Esquire.


01:32:19.706 --> 01:32:21.008
He's an attorney.


01:32:21.041 --> 01:32:22.175
- How do you do, Mr. Hendricks.


01:32:22.208 --> 01:32:24.244
- Very well, Miss
Brown thank you.


01:32:24.276 --> 01:32:27.046
- Have a seat Nellie.


01:32:28.714 --> 01:32:33.251
- I represent friends of yours


01:32:33.284 --> 01:32:35.253
that are willing to
take charge of you


01:32:35.286 --> 01:32:36.553
if you'd rather be with them...


01:32:36.586 --> 01:32:37.388
- Yes.


01:32:37.421 --> 01:32:39.256
- Than in the asylum.


01:32:39.289 --> 01:32:40.491
- Yes.


01:32:40.524 --> 01:32:41.325
- Don't you want to
know who they ...


01:32:41.358 --> 01:32:44.027
- No.


01:32:44.060 --> 01:32:46.362
- Very well.


01:32:46.395 --> 01:32:48.397
I will leave you two to chat,


01:32:48.430 --> 01:32:51.700
while I prepare
your release papers.


01:32:56.070 --> 01:33:00.040
- So Miss, Miss Brown.


01:33:00.073 --> 01:33:03.510
Miss Brown, Miss Brown.


01:33:06.211 --> 01:33:09.815
I am instructed to
provide you with anything,


01:33:09.848 --> 01:33:13.484
anything you need on our
journey back to the city.


01:33:13.517 --> 01:33:15.820
- Something to eat immediately.


01:33:15.853 --> 01:33:18.489
- Of course, of course.


01:33:22.324 --> 01:33:23.793
- I had
looked forward so eagerly


01:33:23.826 --> 01:33:26.195
to leaving that horrible place.


01:33:26.228 --> 01:33:28.663
Yet when my release came,


01:33:28.696 --> 01:33:32.600
and I knew that God's sunlight
was to be free for me again,


01:33:32.633 --> 01:33:35.069
there was a certain
pain in leaving.


01:33:35.102 --> 01:33:37.838
- How long was I
in the nuthouse?


01:33:37.871 --> 01:33:41.274
- You mean you don't know?


01:33:45.243 --> 01:33:47.546
- 10 days.


01:34:10.431 --> 01:34:12.266
Could I pass
a week in the Insane Ward


01:34:12.299 --> 01:34:14.468
at Blackwell's island?


01:34:14.501 --> 01:34:16.837
I said I could and would.


01:34:16.870 --> 01:34:20.807
And I did.


01:34:30.414 --> 01:34:32.349
My story spread like wildfire.


01:34:32.382 --> 01:34:34.651
And spread not only
across the U.S.,


01:34:34.684 --> 01:34:36.420
but across the globe.


01:34:36.453 --> 01:34:37.553
I was a news celebrity.


01:34:37.586 --> 01:34:38.855
- Oh Miss Brown.


01:34:38.888 --> 01:34:40.189
I had
proven that a woman


01:34:40.222 --> 01:34:42.258
could do the man's
job of reporting


01:34:42.291 --> 01:34:44.426
by writing the most
successful piece of news


01:34:44.459 --> 01:34:50.298
Joseph Pulitzer
had ever published.


01:34:56.335 --> 01:35:00.139
But my only focus, my only care


01:35:00.172 --> 01:35:03.242
was for the poor unfortunates
left to wither and die


01:35:03.275 --> 01:35:05.511
in that horrid place.


01:35:05.544 --> 01:35:07.745
I was determined to shed
light on their conditions.


01:35:07.778 --> 01:35:09.580
- The nation is in a
fit over your story.


01:35:09.613 --> 01:35:12.349
The mayor of New York has
launched his own investigation


01:35:12.382 --> 01:35:14.484
as of several members
of the city council.


01:35:14.517 --> 01:35:16.386
This changes everything for you.


01:35:16.419 --> 01:35:17.820
- Yes.


01:35:17.853 --> 01:35:21.557
- Nothing will ever be
the same from here on out.


01:35:21.590 --> 01:35:24.359
- No I expect not.


01:35:24.392 --> 01:35:30.131
- Here, this is for you.


01:35:34.401 --> 01:35:35.568
- It is a lot of money.


01:35:35.601 --> 01:35:36.502
- It includes a bonus,


01:35:36.535 --> 01:35:39.572
authorized by Pulitzer himself.


01:35:39.605 --> 01:35:42.207
- I only want the standard pay,


01:35:42.240 --> 01:35:45.377
the rest should
go to the orphans.


01:35:45.410 --> 01:35:48.245
- Oh yes, you've been summoned


01:35:48.278 --> 01:35:49.847
to appear before the grand jury


01:35:49.880 --> 01:35:52.582
about the conditions
at Blackwell's.


01:35:54.984 --> 01:35:56.452
- Do you swear to
tell the truth,


01:35:56.485 --> 01:35:58.453
the whole truth, and
nothing but the truth,


01:35:58.486 --> 01:35:59.488
so help you God?


01:35:59.521 --> 01:36:02.191
- By the grace of God, I do.


01:36:05.659 --> 01:36:07.261
- Please state your name.


01:36:07.294 --> 01:36:09.363
- Elizabeth Jane Cockerit.


01:36:12.365 --> 01:36:14.401
Nellie Bly is my pen name.


01:36:14.434 --> 01:36:16.802
- Can you tell us why
you feigned insanity


01:36:16.835 --> 01:36:18.871
and entered Blackwell's
Island Lunatic Asylum


01:36:18.904 --> 01:36:21.239
posing as a person
of mental illness?


01:36:21.272 --> 01:36:23.408
- I entered Blackwell's
Asylum with the intent


01:36:23.441 --> 01:36:27.444
of writing about and exposing
corruption abuse there of.


01:36:27.477 --> 01:36:30.881
- So this was a page
on dishonest papers?


01:36:30.914 --> 01:36:33.783
- The job of a reporter is to
tell the truth to the people.


01:36:33.816 --> 01:36:36.385
Truth that would
otherwise not be know.


01:36:36.418 --> 01:36:39.354
At first, I took this
assignment with the notion


01:36:39.387 --> 01:36:41.856
of telling the people what
goes on behind the bars


01:36:41.889 --> 01:36:44.525
and locked doors of the asylum.


01:36:44.558 --> 01:36:46.327
But it was not long
before I realized


01:36:46.360 --> 01:36:47.695
that I had deeper reasons.


01:36:47.728 --> 01:36:48.896
- Care to elaborate?


01:36:48.929 --> 01:36:51.664
- The insane asylum
on Blackwell's Island


01:36:51.697 --> 01:36:53.499
is a human rat trap.


01:36:53.532 --> 01:36:55.500
It is easy to get in,


01:36:55.533 --> 01:36:59.805
but once in it is
impossible to get out.


01:36:59.838 --> 01:37:03.774
Here were women taken
without their consent,


01:37:03.807 --> 01:37:06.643
from the free world to an asylum


01:37:06.676 --> 01:37:10.347
and given no chance
to prove their sanity.


01:37:10.380 --> 01:37:12.681
- Your Honor I'm with that the
Grand Jury be taken on a tour


01:37:12.714 --> 01:37:15.251
of Blackwell's Island
Asylum by Miss Cockerin


01:37:15.284 --> 01:37:17.553
and see these events first hand.


01:37:17.586 --> 01:37:18.519
- It is so ordered.


01:37:25.625 --> 01:37:28.562
- The Grand Jury is here.


01:37:28.595 --> 01:37:29.795
- Yes?


01:37:29.828 --> 01:37:34.333
- We must eliminate all
traces of Brown's visit.


01:37:34.366 --> 01:37:36.534
We are in danger.


01:37:36.567 --> 01:37:36.968
- Just go.


01:37:37.001 --> 01:37:37.669
- But...


01:37:37.702 --> 01:37:38.704
- Just go!


01:37:56.851 --> 01:37:58.653
- You must keep
your questions short


01:37:58.686 --> 01:38:01.589
as her health will not allow it.


01:38:03.691 --> 01:38:07.728
- It's me Nellie.


01:38:09.329 --> 01:38:12.398
Tillie do you know me?


01:38:12.431 --> 01:38:15.000
- No.


01:38:15.033 --> 01:38:16.901
I do not know you.


01:38:21.339 --> 01:38:22.606
Should I?


01:38:40.654 --> 01:38:43.324
- This is not how it was
when I was last here.


01:38:43.357 --> 01:38:45.558
- Have you made changes to
the sitting room recently?


01:38:45.591 --> 01:38:46.959
- The sitting room is
always being changed,


01:38:46.992 --> 01:38:48.995
rearranged and cleaned.


01:38:49.028 --> 01:38:50.862
- Where is Miss
Bridget McGuinness?


01:38:50.895 --> 01:38:52.831
- She has been transferred
to other quarters.


01:38:52.864 --> 01:38:54.333
- What about Mrs. Fox?


01:38:54.366 --> 01:38:58.102
- She is dying of paralysis
and you cannot see her.


01:38:58.135 --> 01:39:01.339
- And Anne Neville,
where is Anne Neville.


01:39:01.372 --> 01:39:03.473
- She has been transferred
to isolation in Hall 7


01:39:03.506 --> 01:39:04.674
due to some troubles.


01:39:04.707 --> 01:39:05.742
- See that she is brought to us.


01:39:16.050 --> 01:39:18.720
- Miss Anne Neville
has been brought down.


01:39:18.753 --> 01:39:20.020
She's in the hallway.


01:39:20.053 --> 01:39:21.088
- Send her in.


01:39:45.107 --> 01:39:48.777
- I knew you would come back.


01:39:50.445 --> 01:39:53.115
- Have they been
giving you medicine?


01:39:57.518 --> 01:39:58.853
- I have to admit,


01:39:58.886 --> 01:40:02.856
I was fearful when they
came for me just now.


01:40:02.889 --> 01:40:06.625
They said I was going to be
examined by a crowd of men.


01:40:06.658 --> 01:40:08.460
- It is a Grand Jury,


01:40:08.493 --> 01:40:12.964
here to investigate Blackwell's
and how they treat us.


01:40:12.997 --> 01:40:14.799
- All I want you to do,


01:40:14.832 --> 01:40:17.033
is to tell the jury
all that we have done


01:40:17.066 --> 01:40:19.370
since I was brought
with you to the asylum.


01:40:31.012 --> 01:40:35.649
- When Miss Brown and
I were brought here,


01:40:37.751 --> 01:40:40.053
the nurses were very cruel.


01:40:44.089 --> 01:40:47.760
The food it was too bad to eat.


01:40:50.028 --> 01:40:52.897
There was not enough clothing.


01:40:52.930 --> 01:40:56.634
Miss Brown asked for
more all the time.


01:40:56.667 --> 01:40:58.868
For when the doctors
promised her more clothing,


01:40:58.901 --> 01:41:04.907
she said she would
give it to me.


01:41:09.477 --> 01:41:15.048
Strange to say,


01:41:18.952 --> 01:41:23.088
ever since Miss Brown
has been taken away,


01:41:23.121 --> 01:41:26.991
everything was different.


01:41:27.024 --> 01:41:30.628
Nurses are very kind to us


01:41:30.661 --> 01:41:34.865
and we are given plenty to wear.


01:41:34.898 --> 01:41:40.970
The doctors come
and see us often.


01:41:45.573 --> 01:41:47.876
- All rise


01:41:47.909 --> 01:41:53.514
for the honorable Judge
Henry A. Gildersleeve.


01:41:57.917 --> 01:41:59.886
Be seated.


01:42:03.121 --> 01:42:06.624
- Has the Grand Jury
reached a decision?


01:42:06.657 --> 01:42:09.827
- We have Your Honor.


01:42:09.860 --> 01:42:11.762
We find the Committee
of Appropriation


01:42:11.795 --> 01:42:13.196
be provided one million dollars


01:42:13.229 --> 01:42:14.865
for the benefit of the asylum.


01:42:18.300 --> 01:42:19.935
In spite of
the attempts to cover up


01:42:19.968 --> 01:42:22.204
what had been going
on at Blackwell's,


01:42:22.237 --> 01:42:25.039
the Grand Jury found that
I was telling the truth


01:42:25.072 --> 01:42:26.808
about all I had testified


01:42:26.841 --> 01:42:30.110
and found my testimony
to be credible.


01:42:30.143 --> 01:42:33.146
I have the consolation that
on the strength of my story,


01:42:33.179 --> 01:42:35.548
the million dollars
per year provided


01:42:35.581 --> 01:42:37.283
was more than had
ever before been given


01:42:37.316 --> 01:42:40.086
for the benefit of the insane.


01:42:40.119 --> 01:42:45.123
- My dear girl, you have
no idea what you've done.


01:42:45.557 --> 01:42:48.692
- Oh I know exactly
what I have done.


01:42:48.725 --> 01:42:50.928
Blackwell's is not
a place of healing.


01:42:50.961 --> 01:42:53.263
It is a rat-infested
human death trap.


01:42:53.296 --> 01:42:55.098
- That is due to
the lack of means


01:42:55.131 --> 01:42:57.934
to secure good medical help.


01:42:57.967 --> 01:43:00.202
Blackwell's Asylum
was forced to choose


01:43:00.235 --> 01:43:04.605
among convicted prisoners
from the nearby penitentiary


01:43:04.638 --> 01:43:06.707
to fill out its staff.


01:43:06.740 --> 01:43:10.277
- You stood by as the nurses
inflicted unspeakable cruelties


01:43:10.310 --> 01:43:11.611
upon patients.


01:43:11.644 --> 01:43:13.280
- Maybe being the
superintendent,


01:43:13.313 --> 01:43:16.882
I was too busy to be fully
aware of the atrocities


01:43:16.915 --> 01:43:18.284
that were going on in here.


01:43:18.317 --> 01:43:20.152
- You knew.


01:43:20.185 --> 01:43:22.120
You knew that clothing
meant for the patients


01:43:22.153 --> 01:43:23.621
was being stolen.


01:43:23.654 --> 01:43:25.990
You knew that women in
here were being murdered.


01:43:26.023 --> 01:43:28.825
- How can you say it was murder!


01:43:28.858 --> 01:43:31.295
I was trying to
help these people!


01:43:31.328 --> 01:43:38.134
I was trying to help
science before it!


01:43:42.070 --> 01:43:45.606
- Dr. Dent you have
made a very old mistake.


01:43:45.639 --> 01:43:47.074
Throughout history
there have been those


01:43:47.107 --> 01:43:48.309
who have allowed atrocities


01:43:48.342 --> 01:43:52.679
with a higher ideal
as an end goal.


01:43:52.712 --> 01:43:56.215
- I had no other goal
than to help my patients.


01:43:58.283 --> 01:44:00.619
- I can see I cannot
convince you to the insanity


01:44:00.652 --> 01:44:04.221
of your thinking.


01:44:04.254 --> 01:44:06.824
But I can stop you.


01:44:06.857 --> 01:44:10.794
The state is taking control
of Blackwell's Asylum.


01:44:10.827 --> 01:44:14.063
One of the conditions is
that the facility be closed


01:44:14.096 --> 01:44:15.097
and torn down.


01:44:30.376 --> 01:44:36.081
Goodbye Dr. Dent.


01:44:39.851 --> 01:44:42.686
- The world
was surprised by my story.


01:44:42.719 --> 01:44:44.922
A story written by a woman.


01:44:44.955 --> 01:44:48.324
A story that brought light
to those that had no voice,


01:44:48.357 --> 01:44:51.227
those that society had forgotten


01:44:51.260 --> 01:44:53.162
and reminded us all


01:44:53.195 --> 01:44:56.164
that energy rightly
applied and directed


01:44:56.197 --> 01:44:57.866
will accomplish anything.


